(60, 'Stanton 20 cm Stainless Steel Casserole With Lid, Handle with Silicone Sleeve, Induction Friendly, 2.5mm, 3L', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Prepare delicious and nutritious meals with the Stanton 20 cm Stainless Steel Casserole, designed for both health and durability. Featuring a full 3-ply body with layers of Stainless Steel and Aluminium, it ensures superior heat distribution for even cooking. The 304 stainless steel construction is non-reactive with food and resistant to rust, promising long-lasting performance. Elegant stainless steel casting handles with silicone sleeves provide a comfortable grip and protection from burns. The casserole\'s ergonomic design includes easy stacking to save space in your kitchen, while its non-porous surface makes cleaning and maintenance effortless. Backed by Wonderchef\'s reliable warranty, this casserole combines functionality with style for your cooking needs.', '2024-07-06 14:39:27', '2024-07-06 14:39:27', 12, 0),
(61, 'Aluminium Hard anodized Tadka Pan Large', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Experience durability and efficiency with the Aluminium Hard Anodized Tadka Pan. Crafted for fast and even cooking, its anodized surface is harder than steel, resistant to chips, and cracks. This environmentally friendly cookware ensures non-toxic cooking without releasing harmful chemicals. Its contemporary design with riveted handles and an elegant dark finish not only enhances aesthetics but also offers functionality. Metal spatula friendly, this pan features a thick exterior coating for color stability and lasting metallic shine. Perfect for everyday use, it combines durability with style for your kitchen essentials.', '2024-07-06 15:12:55', '2024-07-06 15:12:55', 13, 0),
(62, 'Royal Velvet Grill Pan 24cm Red + Teramo Qtr. Plates Set of 2, Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Festivals', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Elevate your culinary experience with the Royal Velvet Grill Pan and Teramo Quarter Plates Gift Combo. The Royal Velvet Grill Pan features a vibrant design with a Meta-tuff non-stick coating for healthy cooking and easy cleaning. Its ergonomic design includes a double pour spout and parallel grill edges for perfect grill marks. Pair this with the Teramo Quarter Plates, handcrafted with premium stoneware fired at high temperatures for durability and a beautiful glaze finish. Ideal for gifting during Diwali and housewarmings, this combo brings style and functionality to any kitchen.', '2024-07-06 15:16:34', '2024-07-06 15:16:34', 14, 0),
(63, 'Orchid Fry Pan 24cm + Austin Serving Casserole Set of 2, Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Other Festivals', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Celebrate the festive season with the Orchid Fry Pan and Austin Serving Casserole Set, an ideal gift for family gatherings and housewarmings. The Orchid Fry Pan, crafted from virgin aluminium with a Meta-tuff non-stick coating, ensures even heat distribution for perfect cooking results and durability. Its ergonomic handle provides a comfortable grip for effortless cooking. Meanwhile, the Austin Serving Casserole, made from rust-resistant stainless steel, keeps food fresh with its innovative dome-shaped glass lid and steam vent. Both pieces combine style and functionality, making them essential additions to any kitchen.', '2024-07-06 15:19:37', '2024-07-06 15:19:37', 14, 0),
(64, 'Regalia Pronto Coffee Maker + Teramo Coffee Mugs Set of 2, Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Other Festivals', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Gift the joy of freshly brewed coffee with the Regalia Pronto Coffee Maker and Teramo Coffee Mugs Set. The Regalia Pronto Coffee Maker brews up to 6 cups of aromatic coffee effortlessly, ensuring a perfect start to your day or a delightful break. Its drip controller prevents spills when the carafe is removed, adding convenience to your brewing experience. Pair it with the Teramo Coffee Mugs, crafted from premium stoneware for durability and a glossy finish, perfect for enjoying your favourite brew in style. This combo, inspired by Italian design and backed by German quality standards, makes a thoughtful gift for coffee lovers during festive occasions.', '2024-07-06 15:21:30', '2024-07-06 15:21:30', 14, 0),
(65, ' Crystal Glasses Set of 6 + Nutri-blend Black 2 Jar , Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Other Festivals,', 7000, 3499, 3501, 'Delight your loved ones with the Nutri-blend 2 Jar and Crystal Glasses Set, a perfect gift for festive occasions. The Nutri-blend Mixer-Grinder-Blender offers superior performance with surgical stainless steel blades that extract essential nutrients from foods. It includes two jars with specialized blades for blending, grinding, and preparing chutneys, shakes, and more. The trademark flower design adds elegance to your kitchen while symbolizing health and quality. Accompanying the Nutri-blend are six stunning crystal glasses, designed for durability and comfort, ideal for serving juices, smoothies, or even small servings of beverages. This combo, inspired by Italian design and crafted to German quality standards, comes with a reliable Wonderchef warranty, ensuring both style and functionality in every use.', '2024-07-06 15:23:42', '2024-07-06 15:23:42', 14, 0),
(66, 'Sippy Stainless Steel Bottle + Nutri-cup Portable Blender, Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Other Festivals', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Give the gift of health with the Nutri-cup Portable Blender and Sippy Stainless Steel Bottle combo! Ideal for health enthusiasts, this set allows you to enjoy delicious smoothies and juices on-the-go. The Nutri-cup features a strong build with BPA-free food-grade materials and sharp stainless steel blades, blending everything from protein shakes to fruit juices effortlessly. Its compact design fits perfectly in bags or car cup holders, powered conveniently via USB charging for added portability. The Sippy Bottle complements this by ensuring hydration throughout the day with its easy-sip cap and durable stainless steel construction. Embrace Italian design and German quality with Wonderchef, backed by a reliable warranty for peace of mind.', '2024-07-06 15:26:41', '2024-07-06 15:26:41', 14, 0),
(67, 'Crescent Kettle 1.8L + Sippy Stainless Steel Bottle, Gift Combo, For Family and Friends, Gift for Diwali and Other Festivals', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Ensure your loved ones stay hydrated and healthy with the Crescent Kettle 1.8L and Sippy Stainless Steel Bottle combo! Perfect for home and office use, the Crescent Kettle is crafted from high-quality stainless steel and BPA-free materials, offering durability and a sleek modern design. Boasting a generous 1.8-liter capacity, it quickly boils water for tea, coffee, or any hot beverage in just 5 to 7 minutes, thanks to features like a 360° swivel base and auto shut off. The accompanying Sippy Bottle keeps hydration convenient with its easy-sip cap and sturdy stainless steel build, ideal for carrying water on the go. Embrace Italian design and German quality with Wonderchef, backed by a reliable warranty for peace of mind.', '2024-07-06 15:29:54', '2024-07-06 15:29:54', 14, 0),
(68, 'HAWKINS CLASSIC', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Classic 1.5,2(wide,small) Litre Pressure Cooker (CL15) is an essential kitchen companion designed for 1 or 2 persons. Crafted from pure virgin aluminium with an exterior mirror polish, it ensures both durability and aesthetic appeal. Its base thickness varies from 3.25 to 4.06 mm, promoting even heat distribution and super-fast cooking. The cooker measures 320 x 170 x 135 mm in its carton and weighs 1.28 kg, making it compact and easy to handle. With a robust 5-year guarantee, this pressure cooker promises longevity and reliability. Ideal for quick meals, it combines efficiency with a sleek design, perfect for modern kitchens.', '2024-07-06 16:38:39', '2024-07-06 16:38:39', 36, 0),
(69, 'HAWKINS Induction INSTAA', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Insta 1.5,2(wide,small) Litre Pressure Cooker (IIH15) is an ideal kitchen tool for small households, catering perfectly to 1 or 2 persons. With a substantial thickness of 4.06 mm, it ensures even heat distribution and robust durability. Its hard anodized surface inside and out makes it non-toxic, hygienic, and ideal for healthy, low-oil cooking. This material does not pit or tarnish, ensuring the cooker stays looking new for years. The extra-thick induction base, also 4.06 mm, remains flat, heats evenly, and prevents food from burning or sticking, making it compatible with both gas and induction stoves. The pressure-locked safety lid guarantees that the cooker will not open until the pressure falls to a safe level, ensuring user safety. Compact with carton dimensions of 319 x 163 x 138 mm and a weight of 1.37 kg, it is easy to handle and store. The 1.5-litre capacity is perfect for quick, efficient cooking. Additionally, it comes with a 5-year guarantee, providing long-term peace of mind. This pressure cooker combines safety, efficiency, and durability, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-07 16:52:44', '2024-07-07 16:52:44', 36, 0),
(70, 'HAWKINS CONTURA', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Contura 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (HC15) is an excellent choice for small households, designed specifically for 1 or 2 persons. It features a robust 3.25 mm thickness, ensuring even heat distribution and durability. With a capacity of 1.5 litres, this pressure cooker is perfect for quick, efficient cooking. Its unique curved body design allows for easy stirring, providing better visibility of food and making it easier to remove food once cooked. The pressure cooker measures 322 x 178 x 135 mm in its carton and weighs 1.455 kg, making it compact and easy to handle. Crafted for both functionality and convenience, it comes with a 5-year guarantee, ensuring long-term reliability and performance. The curved body not only enhances its practicality but also adds a modern touch to its appearance. Ideal for small meals, it combines traditional quality with thoughtful design features to make your cooking experience more enjoyable.', '2024-07-07 16:58:49', '2024-07-07 16:58:49', 36, 0),
(71, 'CERAMIC-COATED HAWKINS CONTURA', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Ceramic-Coated Hawkins Contura (Tomato Red) 3 Litre Pressure Cooker (CTR30) is a stylish and efficient kitchen tool, perfect for households of 3 or 4 persons. With a robust 3.25 mm thickness and a 3-litre capacity, it ensures even heat distribution and durability. The exterior features a non-toxic ceramic coating that is both scratch and stain-resistant, maintaining its vibrant tomato red color for years. The black base heats faster, improving cooking efficiency. The mouth of the cooker body is provided with a metallic rim, adding an extra layer of safety. The cooker measures 342 x 203 x 180 mm in its carton and weighs 2.04 kg, making it sturdy yet manageable. It comes with a 5-year guarantee, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind. The curved design of the body allows for easy stirring and better visibility of food, making cooking and serving more convenient. Combining safety, efficiency, and aesthetics, this pressure cooker is a valuable addition to any modern kitchen.', '2024-07-07 17:01:06', '2024-07-07 17:01:06', 36, 0),
(72, 'HAWKINS CONTURA BLACK', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Contura Black 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (CB15) is an ideal choice for small households, perfect for cooking for 1 or 2 persons. It features a robust 3.25 mm thickness, ensuring even heat distribution and long-lasting durability. With a capacity of 1.5 litres, it is perfect for quick, efficient meal preparation. The hard-anodized body and stainless steel lid ensure that the cooker does not react with food, maintaining the nutritional value and taste of your meals. The black body heats faster, enhancing cooking efficiency. Measuring 322 x 178 x 135 mm in its carton and weighing 1.487 kg, it is compact and easy to handle. The pressure cooker comes with a 5-year guarantee, providing peace of mind and long-term reliability. Its curved body design allows for easy stirring, better visibility of food, and easier removal of cooked food. Combining functionality, safety, and a sleek design, this pressure cooker is a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-07 17:02:53', '2024-07-07 17:02:53', 36, 0),
(73, 'HAWKINS CONTURA BLACK XT', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Contura Black XT 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (CXT15) is perfect for small households, serving 1 or 2 persons. Featuring an extra-thick body with a 4.88 mm thick base, this cooker ensures exceptional durability and heat distribution. The base is designed to stay flat and will not bulge, providing consistent performance over time. With a 1.5-litre capacity, it is ideal for quick and even cooking. The cooker works efficiently on both gas and induction stoves, adding to its versatility. Compact and easy to handle, it measures 317 x 179 x 132 mm in its carton and weighs 1.6 kg. The sleek black body not only heats faster but also adds a modern touch to your kitchen. Additionally, it comes with a 5-year guarantee, ensuring long-term reliability and peace of mind. Combining advanced features and robust construction, this pressure cooker is a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-07 17:04:46', '2024-07-07 17:04:46', 36, 0),
(74, 'HAWKINS STAINLESS STEEL CONTURA', NULL, 0, NULL, 'HAWKINS STAINLESS STEEL CONTURA 1.5 LITRE (SSC15) Thickness: 6.6 mm Capacity: 1.5 litre Carton dimensions (WxDxH): 322 x 186 x 141 mm Weight in carton: 1.785 kg Guarantee: 5 years Ideal for 1 or 2 Persons 100% stainless steel body and lid 6.6 mm thick sandwich bottom heats evenly Works on gas & induction', '2024-07-07 17:09:09', '2024-07-07 17:09:09', 36, 0),
(75, 'HAWKINS TRI-PLY STAINLESS STEEL', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Tri-Ply Stainless Steel 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (HSST15) is an ideal choice for small households, perfect for cooking for 1 or 2 persons. Featuring a 3 mm extra-thick tri-ply stainless steel body, it ensures even heating across the base and sides, preventing food and spices from burning and sticking. This design also reduces the need for oil, promoting healthier cooking. The pressure cooker has a capacity of 1.5 litres, making it suitable for quick, efficient meal preparation. The AISI 430 magnetic stainless steel exterior allows it to work on both gas and induction cooktops, adding versatility to your kitchen. It comes in a compact size, with carton dimensions of 319 x 163 x 144 mm and a weight of 1.57 kg, making it easy to handle and store. With a 5-year guarantee, it promises long-term reliability and peace of mind. Combining advanced tri-ply construction with a sleek, modern design, this pressure cooker is a valuable addition to any kitchen, offering both efficiency and durability.', '2024-07-07 17:12:22', '2024-07-07 17:12:22', 36, 0),
(76, 'FUTURA STAINLESS STEEL', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Futura Stainless Steel 4 Litre Pressure Cooker (FSS40) combines elegance with functionality, making it ideal for serving 4 to 6 persons. It features a robust 7 mm thick base that includes a 4.9 mm aluminium disc sandwiched in stainless steel, ensuring efficient heat dispersion and uniform cooking. With a generous capacity of 4 litres, it is perfect for preparing larger meals with ease. The pressure cooker is crafted entirely from stainless steel, offering durability and a modern aesthetic that complements any kitchen decor. It measures 415 x 250 x 180 mm in its carton and weighs 3.69 kg, making it substantial yet manageable. The cooker is equipped with a fingertip steam release mechanism for added convenience and safety during cooking. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Futura FSS40 promises reliability and peace of mind for years to come. This pressure cooker represents a blend of style and efficiency, making it a valuable addition to households that prioritize both form and function.', '2024-07-07 17:21:29', '2024-07-07 17:21:29', 36, 0),
(77, 'FUTURA HARD ANODISED', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Futura Hard Anodised 2 Litre Pressure Cooker (FP20) is an excellent choice for small to medium-sized households, ideal for 2 or 3 persons. It features a robust 6.35 mm thick base that ensures even heat distribution and stability, staying flat on various cooking surfaces including gas, electric, ceramic, and halogen stoves. With a capacity of 2 litres, it is perfect for quick and efficient meal preparation.  Crafted from hard-anodized aluminum, both the body and lid are non-reactive with food, ensuring that it does not tarnish and remains looking new for years. This material also makes the cooker super-fast, cooking meals 46% faster than a microwave oven.  The pressure cooker comes in a compact size with carton dimensions of 325 x 191 x 190 mm and weighs 2.375 kg, making it easy to handle and store. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, it provides long-term reliability and peace of mind. Combining durability, efficiency, and sleek design, the Futura FP20 is a valuable addition to any kitchen, offering fast and flavorful cooking for your favorite dishes.', '2024-07-07 17:23:19', '2024-07-07 17:23:19', 36, 0),
(78, 'MISS MARY (MM)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Miss Mary 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (MM15) is perfect for small households, serving 1 or 2 persons. With a thickness of 3.25 mm, it ensures even heat distribution and durability. The 1.5-litre capacity is ideal for quick, efficient meal preparation. The pressure cooker is quality-certified by the Bureau of Indian Standards (ISI), ensuring high standards of performance and safety. Each cooker is rigorously tested to prevent leaks. It features a safer, shielded safety valve for added security during cooking. Compact with carton dimensions of 321 x 170 x 136 mm and a weight of 1.13 kg, it is easy to handle and store. Additionally, it comes with a 5-year guarantee, offering long-term reliability. This pressure cooker combines safety, efficiency, and compact design, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-08 03:01:17', '2024-07-08 03:01:17', 36, 0),
(79, 'HAWKINS HEVIBASE', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Hevibase 2 Litre Pressure Cooker (IH20) is designed for small to medium-sized households, ideal for 2 or 3 persons. With a double-thick base of 6.35 mm, it ensures the base stays flat and heats evenly, providing consistent cooking results. The hard anodized base absorbs heat better and cooks faster, enhancing efficiency. It has a 2-litre capacity, perfect for quick and efficient meal preparation. This versatile pressure cooker works on gas, induction, electric, ceramic, and halogen stoves. Compact with carton dimensions of 332 x 181 x 147 mm and a weight of 1.9 kg, it is easy to handle and store. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, it offers long-term reliability. Combining robust construction with advanced features, the Hawkins Hevibase IH20 is a valuable addition to any kitchen, ensuring safe, fast, and efficient cooking.', '2024-07-08 03:04:31', '2024-07-08 03:04:31', 36, 0),
(80, 'HAWKINS BIGBOY', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Bigboy 14 Litre Pressure Cooker (BB14) is designed for large-scale cooking, making it ideal for hotels, restaurants, caterers, or large families serving 14 to 18 persons. With a substantial thickness of 4.06 mm to 4.88 mm, the base ensures even heat distribution and durability. The cooker has a generous 14-litre capacity, perfect for preparing large quantities of food efficiently. It features extra-strong, reinforced fibreglass handles for enhanced safety and ease of handling. Compact for its capacity, the cooker measures 445 x 290 x 360 mm in its carton and weighs 5.045 kg, making it manageable despite its size. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, it promises long-term reliability. The Hawkins Bigboy BB14 combines robust construction with advanced features, making it an essential tool for high-volume cooking needs, ensuring safe and efficient meal preparation on a large scale.', '2024-07-08 03:05:58', '2024-07-08 03:05:58', 36, 0),
(81, 'HAWKINS CERAMIC NON-STICK', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Ceramic NS 1.5 Litre Pressure Cooker (ICC15) is perfect for small households, designed for 1 or 2 persons. Featuring a thickness of 3.25 mm, it ensures even heat distribution and durability. The 1.5-litre capacity is ideal for quick and efficient meal preparation. This cooker boasts a new Hawkins Ceramic Nonstick interior, offering excellent release properties and reducing the need for oil, promoting healthier cooking. The ceramic is high-quality German-made, ensuring it lasts longer and withstands high heat, allowing for crisper and tastier cooking. Compact with carton dimensions of 322 x 178 x 141 mm and a weight of 1.62 kg, it is easy to handle and store. Additionally, it comes with a 5-year guarantee, providing peace of mind and long-term reliability. Combining advanced nonstick technology with robust construction, the Hawkins Ceramic NS ICC15 is a valuable addition to any kitchen, offering both efficiency and health benefits.', '2024-07-08 03:07:46', '2024-07-08 03:07:46', 36, 0),
(82, 'HARD ANODISED DEEP-FRY PAN (ROUND BOTTOM) ', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Deep-Fry Pan (Round Bottom) 1.5 Litre (Kadhai) (AK15) is a versatile and durable addition to any kitchen, ideal for a variety of cooking tasks. With a diameter of 22 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, it ensures even heat distribution and robust performance. The 1.5-litre capacity makes it perfect for sautéing, stir-frying, deep-frying, and cooking gravies, curries, and sauces. Made from hard anodised aluminium, it is tough, durable, and resistant to pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion, ensuring it stays looking new for years. The pan features elegant, comfortable Rosewood handles fixed on sturdy stainless steel brackets, which are permanently riveted for added stability and safety. Its round bottom design offers greater convenience during stir-frying. Compact with carton dimensions of 314 x 228 x 112 mm and a weight of 1 kg, it is easy to handle and store. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, this deep-fry pan combines functionality, durability, and style, making it an essential tool for any kitchen.', '2024-07-08 03:10:06', '2024-07-08 03:10:06', 5, 0),
(83, 'TRIPLY STAINLESS STEEL 2.5 LITRE DEEP-FRY PAN WITH STAINLESS STEEL LID (PSK25S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Triply Stainless Steel 2.5 Litre Deep-Fry Pan with Stainless Steel Lid (PSK25S) is a premium choice for those looking to cook like a professional. With a diameter of 22 cm and an extra-thick 3 mm tri-ply stainless steel construction, this pan ensures even heat distribution and prevents food from sticking and burning, even with minimal oil. Its 2.5-litre capacity makes it perfect for deep-frying, sautéing, and cooking a variety of dishes.  The pan is equipped with stay-cool stainless steel handles, designed for comfortable handling even when the pan is hot. It is versatile and can be used on gas, induction cooktops, and in the oven, making it a flexible addition to any kitchen.  Compact and easy to store, the pan comes with carton dimensions of 363 x 25 x 115 mm and weighs 1.61 kg. The included stainless steel lid adds to its functionality, allowing for better heat retention and faster cooking times. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, this heavy-duty cookware offers long-term reliability and performance, making it an essential tool for any cooking enthusiast.', '2024-07-08 03:13:06', '2024-07-08 03:13:06', 5, 0),
(84, 'HARD ANODISED DEEP-FRY PAN (FLAT BOTTOM) 2 LITRE WITH GLASS LIDWITH 2 SHORT HANDLES (AD20G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Deep-Fry Pan (Flat Bottom) 2 Litre with Glass Lid and Two Short Handles (AD20G) is a versatile and durable addition to any kitchen. With a diameter of 26 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, this pan ensures even heat distribution for efficient cooking. The 2-litre capacity is perfect for deep-frying, sautéing, and preparing a variety of dishes.  The pan features a flat base, making it ideal for both cooking and serving. Its protective hard anodising prevents tarnishing and corrosion, ensuring the pan stays looking new for years. The stay-cool Rosewood handles and knob are natural, durable, and comfortable to hold, enhancing the pan\'s ease of use. Firmly fixed rivets and stainless steel brackets ensure the handles will not loosen over time.  Compact and easy to handle, the pan comes with carton dimensions of 385 x 279 x 114 mm and weighs 2.11 kg. The included glass lid allows for better heat retention and visibility while cooking. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, this hard anodised deep-fry pan combines functionality, durability, and style, making it an essential tool for any kitchen.', '2024-07-08 03:16:06', '2024-07-08 03:16:06', 5, 0),
(85, 'HARD ANODISED DEEP-FRY PAN (FLAT BOTTOM & LONG HANDLE) 2.5 LITREWITH STAINLESS STEEL LID (ADL25S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Deep-Fry Pan (Flat Bottom & Long Handle) 2.5 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (ADL25S) is designed for versatile and efficient cooking. With a diameter of 26 cm and a thickness of 4.06 mm, this pan ensures even heat distribution and robust performance. Its 2.5-litre capacity is ideal for sautéing, stir-frying, deep-frying, and cooking gravies, curries, and sauces using minimal quantities of oil.  Made from hard anodised aluminium, the pan is tough, durable, and resistant to pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion, ensuring it stays looking new for years. The flat bottom provides greater stability on gas stoves and is suitable for use on electric, ceramic, and halogen cooktops.  The pan features elegant and comfortable Rosewood handles fixed on sturdy stainless steel brackets, which are permanently riveted for added stability and safety. It comes with a stainless steel lid that enhances heat retention and cooking efficiency.', '2024-07-08 03:18:13', '2024-07-08 03:18:13', 5, 0),
(86, 'DEEP KADHAI (DEEP-FRY PAN) 2 LITRE (IAK20G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Deep Kadhai (Deep-Fry Pan) 2 Litre (IAK20G) is a high-quality kitchen essential designed for versatile cooking. With a diameter of 20 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, it ensures even heat distribution, reducing the risk of burning and sticking. Its 2-litre capacity is perfect for deep-frying, sautéing, and cooking a variety of dishes.  Made from heavy-gauge, high-grade aluminium, this kadhai diffuses heat evenly for efficient cooking. The strong 2.5 mm thick stainless steel handle brackets are designed to stay firmly in place and not loosen over time. The toughened, heat-proof glass lid allows easy monitoring of food while cooking and serving at the table.  Equipped with stay-cool Rosewood knob and handles, the kadhai is comfortable to hold and handle, enhancing the cooking experience. Compact and easy to store, it has carton dimensions of 36 x 23.8 x 13 mm and weighs 1.713 kg. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Deep Kadhai IAK20G combines durability, functionality, and style, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-08 03:21:18', '2024-07-08 03:21:18', 5, 0),
(87, 'NONSTICK ALL PURPOSE PAN 2.5 LITRE WITH STAINLESS STEEL LID (NAP25)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Nonstick All Purpose Pan 2.5 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (NAP25) is a versatile and durable kitchen essential. With a diameter of 22 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, this pan ensures even heat distribution for efficient cooking. Its 2.5-litre capacity makes it ideal for sautéing, stir-frying, deep-frying, and frying, offering a range of cooking options.  The pan features a PFOA-free nonstick coating that is locked into tough hard anodised aluminium, ensuring the coating lasts longer and providing a healthier cooking surface. It comes with a snug-fit, dome-shaped stainless steel lid, which is perfect for simmering and prevents splatter of hot foods.', '2024-07-08 03:25:36', '2024-07-08 03:25:36', 5, 0),
(88, 'CAST IRON FRYING PAN 24 CM (CIF24G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Cast Iron Frying Pan 24 cm (CIF24G) is a robust and versatile addition to any kitchen, designed for cooking a variety of dishes with ease. With a diameter of 24 cm and a thickness of 5 mm, this pan retains and distributes heat evenly, making it ideal for frying, searing, and browning.  It features a natural nonstick surface due to its seasoned cast iron construction, ensuring healthy and flavorful cooking without the need for additional coatings. The pan can withstand high heat and retains heat well, allowing for excellent cooking results.  Known for its durability, the cast iron material is rough and tough, making it suitable for use with metal ladles and utensils. Pre-seasoned with vegetable oil, the pan is protected from rust with regular care and maintenance.', '2024-07-08 03:28:27', '2024-07-08 03:28:27', 5, 0),
(89, 'CERAMIC NONSTICK FRYING PAN 19 CM WITH GLASS LID (ICF19G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Ceramic Nonstick Frying Pan 19 cm with Glass Lid (ICF19G) from Hawkins is a versatile and health-conscious choice for cooking. With a diameter of 20 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, this pan offers even heat distribution and durability. Its 1.27-litre capacity makes it suitable for various cooking tasks, from frying to sautéing.\r\nThe pan features Hawkins\' new Ceramic Nonstick Inside, which provides excellent release properties, allowing for healthier cooking with 36% less oil while still achieving tasty dishes. It is designed to withstand high heat, ensuring food cooks crisply and maintains its flavors.\r\nImportantly, the pan is free from PTFE, PFOA, PFAS, and heavy metals, making it a safer and more hygienic choice for nonstick cooking. The German ceramic used is of high quality, ensuring longevity and consistent performance.\r\nThe included glass lid fits snugly, allowing for easy monitoring of food while cooking. Compact with carton dimensions of 352 x 221 x 104 mm and weighing 1.405 kg, it is easy to handle and store. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Hawkins Ceramic Nonstick Frying Pan ICF19G combines innovation with health benefits, making it an excellent addition to any kitchen focused on healthy cooking.', '2024-07-08 03:41:57', '2024-07-08 03:41:57', 5, 0),
(90, 'CERAMIC NONSTICK FRYING PAN 19 CM WITH GLASS LID (ICF19G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Ceramic Nonstick Frying Pan 19 cm with Glass Lid (ICF19G) by Hawkins is a pinnacle of modern kitchen innovation. With a diameter of 20 cm and a robust 3.25 mm thickness, it ensures even heat distribution for efficient cooking. Its 1.27-litre capacity makes it ideal for everyday cooking needs, from frying eggs to sautéing vegetables.\r\n\r\nFeaturing Hawkins\' advanced Ceramic Nonstick Inside, this pan offers outstanding release properties, requiring 36% less oil for healthier yet delicious dishes. It excels under high heat, allowing foods to cook crisper and tastier without compromising on health benefits.\r\n\r\nFree from harmful substances like PTFE, PFOA, PFAS, and heavy metals, this pan employs a ceramic-based nonstick coating that is both hygienic and healthier for cooking. The high-quality German ceramic ensures durability and longevity, promising years of reliable performance.\r\n\r\nComplete with a fitted glass lid, which aids in easy monitoring of food while cooking, this pan is compact and weighs 1.405 kg in its carton. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Hawkins Ceramic Nonstick Frying Pan ICF19G is a must-have for any kitchen seeking superior nonstick performance and health-conscious cooking solutions.', '2024-07-08 03:45:21', '2024-07-08 03:45:21', 5, 0),
(91, 'HARD ANODISED FRYING PAN 17 CM (AF17)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Frying Pan 17 cm (AF17) from Hawkins is a compact yet robust choice for your kitchen needs. With a diameter of 17 cm and a substantial thickness of 4.06 mm, it ensures durability and even heat distribution for efficient cooking.\r\n\r\nCrafted from hard anodised aluminium, this pan is tough and resistant to pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion, ensuring it retains its new appearance over years of use. Its heavy gauge construction provides a good balance, making cooking both easy and enjoyable, with delicious results.\r\n\r\nThe Futura Hard Anodised surface is non-toxic, non-staining, and non-reactive with foods, making it a safe option for cooking. It heats up quickly and evenly, delivering thermal efficiency that\'s not affected by high heat.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a stay-cool plastic handle, the pan ensures comfortable handling during cooking. Compact and lightweight, it weighs 0.85 kg in its carton, with dimensions of 340 x 194 x 72 mm. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Hawkins Hard Anodised Frying Pan AF17 combines durability, efficiency, and safety, making it an excellent addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-08 03:46:49', '2024-07-08 03:46:49', 5, 0),
(92, 'HARD ANODISED FRYING PAN 17 CM WITH STAINLESS STEEL LID (AF17S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Frying Pan 17 cm with Stainless Steel Lid (AF17S) by Hawkins is a durable and versatile addition to your kitchen arsenal. With a diameter of 17 cm and a thickness of 4.06 mm, this pan ensures even heat distribution and excellent cooking performance.\r\n\r\nCrafted from hard anodised aluminium, the pan is tough and resilient, resistant to pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion. It maintains its new appearance over years of use, ensuring long-lasting durability. The heavy gauge construction provides a balanced cooking experience, making it easy to achieve delicious results every time.\r\n\r\nFeaturing Futura Hard Anodised surface, this pan is non-toxic, non-staining, and non-reactive with foods, ensuring safe cooking practices. It heats up quickly and evenly, offering efficient thermal conductivity that is unaffected by high heat.\r\n\r\nThe pan is equipped with a stay-cool plastic handle, ensuring comfortable handling during cooking. Additionally, it comes with a sturdy stainless steel lid, enhancing its versatility for various cooking tasks.\r\n\r\nCompact and convenient, it weighs 0.98 kg in its carton and has dimensions of 340 x 194 x 72 mm. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Hawkins Hard Anodised Frying Pan AF17S combines durability, functionality, and safety, making it an essential tool for any kitchen enthusiast.', '2024-07-08 03:49:34', '2024-07-08 03:49:34', 5, 0),
(93, 'Hawkins Futura 26 cm Frying Pan, Non Stick Fry Pan with Glass Lid, Frypan (NF26G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Hawkins brings you a reliable and versatile 1.5-litre Nonstick Cookware, featuring a PFOA-free non-stick coating fused with durable Hard Anodised Aluminium. This combination ensures longevity and superior performance, making it ideal for everyday cooking needs. Its heavy gauge construction provides a balanced cooking experience, ensuring delicious results with minimal effort.\r\n\r\nPerfect for health-conscious cooking, this cookware allows you to prepare meals with less or no oil or butter, thanks to its excellent non-stick properties. The stay-cool plastic handle offers comfortable grip and control during cooking sessions, enhancing user convenience.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a glass lid, this cookware allows for easy monitoring of food while retaining heat and moisture. It is compatible with a variety of stovetops including gas, kerosene, electric, ceramic, and halogen, ensuring versatility in your kitchen.\r\n\r\nFor maintenance, hand washing is recommended to preserve the non-stick coating and prolong the cookware\'s lifespan. With a sleek black finish, Hawkins 1.5-litre Nonstick Cookware combines functionality, durability, and ease of use, making it an essential choice for modern kitchens.', '2024-07-08 03:53:19', '2024-07-08 03:53:19', 5, 0),
(94, 'HARD ANODISED FRYING PAN (STAINLESS STEEL HANDLE) 29 CM WITH STAINLESS STEEL LID (AF29S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hard Anodised Frying Pan (Stainless Steel Handle) 29 cm with Stainless Steel Lid (AF29S) by Hawkins is designed for durability and excellent cooking performance. With a generous diameter of 29 cm and a robust thickness of 4.06 mm, this pan ensures even heat distribution and reliability.\r\n\r\nCrafted from hard anodised aluminium, the pan is tough and resistant to pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion, maintaining its new appearance over years of use. Its heavy gauge construction provides a balanced cooking experience, making it easy to achieve delicious results with every dish.\r\n\r\nFeaturing the Futura Hard Anodised surface, this pan is non-toxic, non-staining, and non-reactive with foods, ensuring safe and hygienic cooking practices. It heats up quickly and evenly, delivering efficient thermal conductivity that remains unaffected by high heat.\r\n\r\nThe pan is equipped with a stay-cool stainless steel handle, offering comfortable handling during cooking. Additionally, it includes a sturdy stainless steel lid, enhancing its versatility for various cooking tasks and helping to retain moisture and flavors.\r\n\r\nWeighing 2.15 kg in its carton and with dimensions of 523 x 311 x 96 mm, this pan is substantial yet manageable. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, the Hawkins Hard Anodised Frying Pan AF29S combines durability, functionality, and safety, making it an essential choice for any kitchen enthusiast.', '2024-07-08 03:55:25', '2024-07-08 03:55:25', 5, 0),
(95, 'DIE CAST FRYING PAN 22 CM (IDCF22)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Die Cast Frying Pan 22 cm (IDCF22) from Hawkins is a robust and versatile addition to your kitchenware collection. With a diameter of 22 cm and an impressive thickness of 6 mm, this pan ensures superior heat distribution and resistance to warping.\r\n\r\nCrafted from die-cast aluminium, the pan features an extra-thick 6 mm base that prevents food from burning or sticking, making it suitable for a variety of cooking techniques. Inside, it boasts a durable nonstick coating that is firmly fixed to the aluminium, ensuring effortless food release and easy cleanup.\r\n\r\nOn the outside, the pan is coated with a hi-tech ceramic coating that is scratch-resistant and stain-resistant, maintaining its sleek appearance over time. It is equipped with Ezee-Pour, no-drip spouts on both sides, making pouring easy and mess-free for both left-handed and right-handed users.\r\n\r\nWeighing 1.33 kg in its carton and with dimensions of 391 x 266 x 95 mm, the Hawkins Die Cast Frying Pan IDCF22 is designed for durability and convenience. It comes with a 2-year guarantee, making it a reliable choice for everyday cooking needs, whether you\'re sautéing, frying, or preparing delicate dishes.', '2024-07-08 03:57:14', '2024-07-08 03:57:14', 5, 0),
(96, 'DIE CAST FRYING PAN 22 CM WITH GLASS LID (IDCF22G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Die Cast Frying Pan 22 cm with Glass Lid (IDCF22G) from Hawkins combines robust construction with practical features for efficient cooking. It features a 6 mm thick base to prevent food from sticking or burning, a durable nonstick coating inside, and a scratch-resistant hi-tech ceramic coating outside. It also includes Ezee-Pour, no-drip spouts for convenient pouring, suitable for both left-handed and right-handed users. Weighing 1.78 kg in its carton and backed by a 2-year guarantee, it offers reliable performance for a variety of culinary tasks.', '2024-07-08 04:00:03', '2024-07-08 04:00:03', 5, 0),
(97, 'TRI-PLY STAINLESS STEEL FRYING PAN 20 CM (SSF20)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Frying Pan 20 cm (SSF20) from Hawkins is crafted for exceptional cooking performance and durability. With a 3 mm thickness and a diameter of 20 cm, this pan ensures even heat distribution and is designed to resist rust and corrosion.\r\n\r\nMade from superior, rust-proof, food-grade Tri-Ply Stainless Steel, the cooking surface features AISI 304, 18/8 food-grade stainless steel, which is hygienic, durable, and non-reactive. This material ensures that food does not stick or burn easily, providing reliable results with every use.\r\n\r\nPackaged in a carton measuring 407 x 232 x 64 mm and weighing 1.13 kg, the SSF20 frying pan comes with a 5-year guarantee, making it a dependable choice for your kitchen needs.', '2024-07-08 04:01:52', '2024-07-08 04:01:52', 5, 0),
(98, 'FRYING PAN 22 CM (NSF22G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Frying Pan 22 cm (NSF22G) combines robust construction with practical features for efficient cooking. It features a PFOA-free nonstick surface shielded by stainless steel ridges, allowing the use of metal spatulas and ensuring durability. The pan\'s 3 mm thick Tri-Ply construction retains heat well and ensures even cooking.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a stay-cool rosewood handle for comfortable handling, even when the pan is hot, and stainless steel rivets and brackets that are firmly fixed to prevent loosening. Packaged in a carton measuring 426 x 241 x 120 mm and weighing 2.131 kg, it comes with a 2-year guarantee, making it a reliable choice for your kitchen.', '2024-07-08 04:03:43', '2024-07-08 04:03:43', 5, 0),
(99, 'Hawkins Hard Anodised Saucepan 1 Litre (EZEE-POUR) (AS10)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Introducing the Hawkins Hard Anodised Saucepan 1 Litre (EZEE-POUR) (AS10), designed for durability and convenience. With a 14 cm diameter and 3.25 mm thickness, this saucepan offers a generous 1 litre capacity. The hard anodised aluminium construction ensures it won\'t pit, tarnish, or corrode, maintaining a like-new appearance for years. The advanced EZEE POUR spout provides almost no-drip pouring, while the stay-cool plastic handle, attached with a sturdy stainless steel bracket, ensures a secure grip. This robust saucepan is built to last and comes with a 5-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 316 x 162 x 108 mm, weight: 0.8 kg.', '2024-07-08 15:49:30', '2024-07-08 15:49:30', 9, 0),
(100, ' Hawkins Hard Anodised Saucepan 2.25 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (AS225S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Hard Anodised Saucepan 2.25 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (AS225S) combines durability and functionality. With an 18 cm diameter and 3.25 mm thickness, this saucepan boasts a 2.25 litre capacity. Constructed from hard anodised aluminium, it resists pitting, tarnishing, and corrosion, ensuring it looks new for years. The flared rims facilitate easy pouring, and the stay-cool plastic handle, secured by a robust stainless steel bracket, provides a comfortable grip. The saucepan includes a matching stainless steel lid. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, it is built to last. Carton dimensions: 351 x 205 x 121 mm, weight: 1.33 kg.', '2024-07-09 15:11:06', '2024-07-09 15:11:06', 9, 0),
(101, ' Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre (NS30)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre (NS30) offers superior cooking performance and longevity. With a 20 cm diameter and 3.25 mm thickness, this saucepan provides a 3 litre capacity. The PFOA-free nonstick coating, made in Germany, is locked into the tough hard anodised aluminium, ensuring it lasts longer than ordinary nonstick. The flared rims make pouring easy, and the stay-cool plastic handle, permanently riveted to the pan, ensures a comfortable grip. This high-quality nonstick saucepan is backed by a 2-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 387 x 235 x 126 mm, weight: 1.32 kg.', '2024-07-09 15:13:11', '2024-07-09 15:13:11', 9, 0),
(102, 'Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre with Glass Lid (NS30G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre with Glass Lid (NS30G) combines durability and convenience for exceptional cooking. Featuring a 20 cm diameter and 3.25 mm thickness, this saucepan offers a 3 litre capacity. Its PFOA-free nonstick coating, made in Germany, is bonded to the tough hard anodised aluminium, ensuring a longer lifespan. The flared rims facilitate easy pouring, and the stay-cool plastic handle, permanently riveted to the pan, ensures a secure grip. This saucepan comes with a convenient glass lid. It is backed by a 2-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 367 x 240 x 146 mm, weight: 1.795 kg.', '2024-07-09 15:14:59', '2024-07-09 15:14:59', 9, 0);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `original_price`, `offer_price`, `discount`, `description`, `created`, `modified`, `category_id`, `company_id`) VALUES
(103, 'Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (NS30S)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Nonstick Saucepan 3 Litre with Stainless Steel Lid (NS30S) offers premium quality and lasting performance. With a diameter of 20 cm and a thickness of 3.25 mm, this saucepan has a 3 litre capacity. The PFOA-free nonstick coating, made in Germany, is securely bonded to the hard anodised aluminium for enhanced durability. Flared rims ensure easy pouring, and the stay-cool plastic handle, permanently riveted to the pan, provides a comfortable grip. This saucepan includes a sturdy stainless steel lid and comes with a 2-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 387 x 235 x 126 mm, weight: 1.48 kg.', '2024-07-09 15:16:09', '2024-07-09 15:16:09', 9, 0),
(104, ' Hawkins Stainless Steel T Pan 1 Litre without Lid (SST10)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Stainless Steel T Pan 1 Litre without Lid (SST10) is designed for healthy and hygienic cooking. With a diameter of 15 cm and a thickness of 0.9 mm, this pan has a 1 litre capacity. Made from superior, \"rust-proof\" food-grade stainless steel, it ensures long-lasting performance. The 4.7 mm extra-thick sandwich bottom stays flat, heats evenly, and prevents hotspots. Its AISI 430 grade magnetic stainless steel base makes it compatible with both gas and induction cooktops. The stay-cool plastic handle, fixed on a sturdy stainless steel bracket and permanently riveted to the pan, provides a secure grip. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, this T pan is a reliable kitchen essential. Carton dimensions: 320 x 172 x 98 mm, weight: 0.815 kg.', '2024-07-09 15:23:27', '2024-07-09 15:23:27', 9, 0),
(105, 'Hawkins Stainless Steel T Pan 1 Litre with Glass Lid (SST10G)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Stainless Steel T Pan 1 Litre with Glass Lid (SST10G) is ideal for healthy and hygienic cooking. With a 15 cm diameter and 0.9 mm thickness, this pan has a 1 litre capacity. Made from superior, \"rust-proof\" food-grade stainless steel, it ensures long-lasting use. The 4.7 mm extra-thick sandwich bottom stays flat, heats evenly, and prevents hotspots. Its AISI 430 grade magnetic stainless steel base works well on both gas and induction cooktops. The stay-cool plastic handle, attached with a sturdy stainless steel bracket and permanently riveted, provides a secure grip. This pan comes with a convenient glass lid. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, it\'s a durable and reliable kitchen essential. Carton dimensions: 320 x 172 x 118 mm, weight: 1.02 kg.', '2024-07-10 13:56:13', '2024-07-10 13:56:13', 9, 0),
(106, 'Hawkins TAVA 30 CM (AT30P)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Tava 30 cm (AT30P) offers exceptional cooking performance with its robust design. Featuring a 30 cm diameter and 4.88 mm thickness, this tava is perfect for various cooking needs. The protective hard anodising ensures it won\'t pit, tarnish, or corrode, maintaining its new look for years. Made from heavy gauge pure, virgin aluminium, it diffuses heat quickly and evenly. The strong 3.15 mm thick stainless steel bracket, along with two sturdy stainless steel rivets, ensures the handle remains secure and won\'t loosen. The well-balanced design of the pan and handle makes it easy to cook with. Backed by a 5-year guarantee, this tava is a reliable addition to any kitchen. Carton dimensions: 46 x 31.8 x 8.3 mm, weight: 1.73 kg.', '2024-07-10 13:59:55', '2024-07-10 13:59:55', 3, 0),
(107, 'Hawkins Square Tava 26 cm (CIST26)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Square Tava 26 cm (CIST26) is designed for healthy and tasty cooking. With a 26 cm diameter and 4.9 mm thickness, this tava is naturally nonstick, allowing you to cook without any coating. It retains heat well, making it ideal for high-heat cooking and ensuring crispy, delicious food. Its rough and tough design can withstand metal ladles, providing durability for everyday use. Pre-seasoned with vegetable oil, this tava will not rust with regular care. It is backed by a 5-year guarantee, ensuring long-lasting performance. Carton dimensions: 36.6 x 27.4 x 4.8 mm, weight: 2.747 kg.', '2024-07-10 14:02:08', '2024-07-10 14:02:08', 3, 0),
(108, 'Hawkins Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Tawa (Wooden Handle) 24 cm (SSTV24)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Tava (Wooden Handle) 24 cm (SSTV24) offers superior cooking performance with a touch of elegance. Featuring a 24 cm diameter and 3.5 mm thickness, this tava is made from \"rust-proof\" food-grade tri-ply stainless steel. The cooking surface, constructed from AISI 304, 18/8 food grade stainless steel, is hygienic, durable, and non-reactive, ensuring it won\'t pit or corrode. The extra-thick tri-ply design ensures food does not stick or burn, providing an excellent cooking experience. The wooden handle offers a comfortable grip and adds a classic look to your kitchen. This tava comes with a 5-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 444 x 255 x 75 mm, weight: 1.32 kg.', '2024-07-10 14:05:03', '2024-07-10 14:05:03', 3, 0),
(109, 'Hawkins Tava 26 cm (NSPT26)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Hawkins Tava 26 cm (NSPT26) is designed for durability and excellent cooking performance. With a 26 cm diameter and 3.5 mm thickness, this tava features a nonstick surface shielded by stainless steel ridges, allowing you to use metal spatulas with less wear and tear. The extra-thick tri-ply construction retains heat well and ensures even cooking. The stay-cool rosewood handle provides a comfortable grip, even when the tava is hot. Stainless steel rivets and a sturdy bracket firmly fix the handle, ensuring it will not loosen. This tava comes with a 2-year guarantee. Carton dimensions: 441 x 270 x 90 mm, weight: 1.29 kg.', '2024-07-10 14:12:01', '2024-07-10 14:12:01', 3, 0),
(110, 'India\'s First ISI Mark Triply Stainless Steel Cooker - Xpress Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Introducing the Xpress Cooker, India\'s first ISI-certified triply pressure cooker, designed for efficiency and safety. Its broad shape is perfect for cooking with inserts or large portions. Made with premium triply material, it conducts heat effectively, reducing cooking time while retaining nutrients and flavor. This cooker has undergone rigorous testing, including 18 quality checks and pressure tests six times its capacity. The inner gasket offers double protection. Proudly made in India, it comes with a 5-year warranty. For more details, contact AUTOPRESS (INDIA) PVT. LTD. in Pune, Maharashtra.', '2024-07-10 14:16:46', '2024-07-10 14:16:46', 36, 0),
(111, 'Baby Xpress Cooker: A Small Pressure Cooker with a Big Advantage!', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Baby Xpress Cooker is perfect for small families or cooking smaller portions, offering efficiency in a compact design. Proudly India\'s first ISI Mark Triply Pressure Cooker, it features a double safety mechanism and a long-lasting, easy-to-clean custom gasket. Made from triply material, it ensures the safest and fastest cooking experience. Each cooker undergoes 18 stringent quality checks and pressure tests six times its capacity. It comes with a 5-year warranty and is proudly made in India. For more details, contact AUTOPRESS (INDIA) PVT. LTD. in Pune, Maharashtra.', '2024-07-10 14:21:26', '2024-07-10 14:21:26', 36, 0),
(112, 'India\'s Only BIS Certified Triply Pan Cooker!', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Xpress Pan Cooker offers unmatched versatility, allowing you to temper, sauté, and stir-fry with ease. Its unique pan shape makes it ideal for various cooking methods. The SS304 layer ensures food safety, while the middle layer provides even heat distribution for fast cooking, retaining taste and nutrition. Your food has zero contact with aluminum. This cooker undergoes over 18 quality tests and is pressure tested at six times its capacity. Proudly made in India, it comes with a 5-year warranty. For more information, contact AUTOPRESS (INDIA) PVT. LTD. in Pune, Maharashtra.', '2024-07-10 14:25:38', '2024-07-10 14:25:38', 36, 0),
(113, 'A Cooker that Wears Many Hats! - Versatil Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Versatil Cooker is the future of pressure cooking, featuring a clasp-on lid for easy operation and cooking. Crafted from the finest quality triply, it is fast, safe, and elegantly robust. Use it as a pressure cooker, pan, and serveware. It includes a glass lid for steaming and serving. The pressure lid has a double safety mechanism for a secure cooking experience. This versatile cooker is beautifully designed and highly reliable, perfect for any kitchen. Proudly made in India, it comes with a 5-year warranty. For more information, contact AUTOPRESS (INDIA) PVT. LTD. in Pune, Maharashtra.', '2024-07-10 14:27:25', '2024-07-10 14:27:25', 36, 0),
(114, 'India\'s First ISI Mark Triply Stainless Steel Cooker - Xpress Cooker -  Belly / Handi', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Discover the Xpress Cooker, India\'s pioneering ISI-certified triply pressure cooker designed for efficiency and excellence. Crafted in a broad shape, it accommodates inserts and larger portions effortlessly. Engineered with premium triply material, this cooker ensures rapid and efficient heat conduction, reducing cooking time while preserving nutrients and flavors. Ideal for everyday meals, pressure cooking with the Xpress Cooker retains food quality and enhances convenience.\r\n\r\nEach Stahl Xpress pressure cooker undergoes rigorous quality checks, including 18 meticulous tests and pressure tests six times its capacity, ensuring durability and safety in every use. Backed by a generous 5-year warranty, it is proudly made in India, exemplifying quality craftsmanship and innovation.', '2024-07-10 14:31:15', '2024-07-10 14:31:15', 36, 0),
(115, 'Cooker Duo (3L & 5L) - Versatile Triply Pressure Cookers', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Discover the Cooker Duo, a versatile set featuring two sizes—3 liters and 5 liters—with unique lids for multifunctional cooking. Made from durable triply stainless steel, these cookers ensure even heating, easy maintenance, and long-lasting performance. The set includes a pressure cooker lid and a convenient glass lid, allowing you to cook on an open flame and serve directly from the cooker.\r\n\r\nDesigned with safety in mind, the Cooker Duo includes a resettable safety valve that can be easily managed with a pin. Ideal for various cooking needs, from everyday meals to special occasions, these cookers transition seamlessly from stove to table, making them perfect for home use or as thoughtful gifts.', '2024-07-10 14:33:04', '2024-07-10 14:33:04', 36, 0),
(116, 'Vinod Platinum Triply Deep Pan Pressure Cooker (Induction Friendly)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Discover the Vinod Platinum Triply Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker, designed for efficient and nutritious cooking. Constructed using SAS technology, it features a triple-layer build of stainless steel, aluminum, and stainless steel. The inner layer, crafted from AISI 304 food-grade stainless steel, ensures hygiene and resistance to rust.\r\n\r\nThe aluminum middle layer facilitates even heat distribution, leading to uniform cooking. The outer layer, made of AISI 430 grade magnetic stainless steel, makes the cooker compatible with both induction cooktops and gas stoves.\r\n\r\nIdeal for cooking a variety of dishes—from dal and rice to vegetables and meats—quickly and efficiently, this pressure cooker saves time and energy. Its matte-finished inner surface prevents food particles from sticking, preserving the food\'s color, taste, and aroma. Plus, its corrosion-resistant design ensures safe and contamination-free cooking, even with acidic ingredients like tomatoes or tamarind.\r\n\r\nComfortable handles make handling easy, making it a practical addition to any kitchen. Available in capacities of 2L, 3.5L, and 4.5L, the Vinod Platinum Triply Pressure Cooker is your go-to solution for wholesome meals with minimal effort.', '2024-07-10 14:46:42', '2024-07-10 14:46:42', 36, 0),
(117, 'Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Inner Lid Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Discover the Vinod Inner Lid Pressure Cooker, a top-selling cookware range renowned for its blend of style and functionality. Designed to steam food thoroughly with minimal oil, this cooker ensures every meal is healthy and nutritious. Its sandwich bottom base features an aluminum core encapsulated between layers of stainless steel (SAS), ensuring even cooking and preventing food from burning.\r\n\r\nCrafted from 304 high-grade stainless steel, the inner layer guarantees hygiene, safety, and easy cleaning. Ideal for preparing quick meals like rice, dal, curries, and even baking, it features a pressure-locked safety lid that only opens once pressure drops, ensuring secure cooking.\r\n\r\nHeat-resistant handles provide a firm grip and remain cool during use, enhancing comfort and safety. The fusible safety valve fits perfectly, enhancing the cooking experience by making it both secure and effortless.\r\n\r\nAvailable in a variety of capacities—2L, 3L, 3.5L, 5L, 5.5L, and 7L—the Vinod Inner Lid Pressure Cooker is your go-to solution for efficient and reliable cooking.', '2024-07-10 14:50:48', '2024-07-10 14:50:48', 36, 0),
(118, 'Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Magic Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Experience the excellence of Vinod Pressure Cookers, meticulously crafted in India to the highest quality standards. Say goodbye to long hours in the kitchen with the ability to steam fresh vegetables, cook rice, dal, or meat dishes in mere minutes!\r\n\r\nThese cookers are designed to preserve the flavor and nutrients of your food while ensuring time and energy efficiency. Featuring Vinod\'s innovative sandwich bottom with aluminum encapsulated stainless steel (SAS) technology, they deliver even cooking and prevent food from burning. The Gasket Release system and Fusible safety valve guarantee maximum safety during use.\r\n\r\nConstructed from ultra-hygienic, food-grade stainless steel with a flawless mirror-finish interior, these cookers ensure food doesn\'t stick when served. They are also resistant to corrosion from acidic foods like tamarind or tomatoes, ensuring contamination-free cooking. The ergonomic handle provides a comfortable and secure grip, enhancing ease of use.\r\n\r\nCompatible with both induction and gas stoves, the Vinod Magic Pressure Cooker comes with a 24-month warranty, underscoring its durability and reliability for your kitchen needs.', '2024-07-10 16:03:37', '2024-07-10 16:07:40', 36, 0),
(119, 'Kraft Hard Anodised Magic Pressure Cooker (Induction Friendly)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Discover efficiency and style with the Kraft Hard Anodised Magic Pressure Cooker from Vinod Cookware. Featuring a sleek black body, this cooker heats up faster and cooks food swiftly, thanks to its extra-thick base that retains heat exceptionally well.\r\n\r\nThe set includes a cooker pot, a strainer lid, a pressure cooking lid, and a serving lid, offering versatility in your kitchen tasks. Crafted from hard anodised virgin aluminium, it boasts durability by preventing surface chipping, peeling, and resisting abrasion and corrosion. This ensures chemical stability, safeguarding against corrosion even with acidic foods.\r\n\r\nDesigned for convenience, the heat-resistant handles provide a sturdy grip for easy lifting. Compatible with both gas stoves and induction cooktops, this cooker is equipped with a fusible safety valve and a gasket release system (GRS) for a secure cooking experience.\r\n\r\nPerfect for preparing a variety of dishes including pastas, dal, rice, khichdi, vegetables, and meats, the Kraft Hard Anodised Magic Pressure Cooker streamlines your cooking process, reducing time spent in the kitchen.', '2024-07-10 16:18:50', '2024-07-10 16:18:50', 36, 0),
(120, 'Vinod Stainless Steel Deep Pan Pressure Cooker With Lid (Induction Friendly)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Introducing the Vinod Stainless Steel Deep Pan Pressure Cooker, a bestseller from the \'House of Vinod\' that perfectly blends aesthetics with functionality. This cooker ensures healthy and nutritious meals by steaming food thoroughly with less oil. Designed for both induction and gas stoves, it features an ultra-hygienic, mirror-finish interior that prevents food from sticking and resists corrosion from acidic foods like tamarind and tomatoes.\r\n\r\nThe versatile Deep Pan Pressure Cooker can also be used as a kadai without the lid for various dishes. Its special sandwich (SAS) bottom ensures even cooking, preventing food from burning. The comfortable, easy-to-hold handles enhance your cooking experience. Prepare vegetables, soups, sauces, rice, dal, and meat dishes quickly and efficiently, saving time in the kitchen.', '2024-07-11 14:22:15', '2024-07-11 14:22:15', 36, 0),
(121, 'Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Outer Lid Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Outer Lid Pressure Cooker is a top-selling product from the House of Vinod, combining aesthetics and functionality for exceptional value. This pressure cooker features easy-to-hold, cool-touch handles and a sandwich bottom base that ensures even heat distribution, reducing cooking time. Perfect for quick meals, it cooks dal, rice, khichdi, vegetables, and meat dishes efficiently while preserving nutrients.\r\n\r\nDesigned with safety in mind, it includes a fusible safety valve and a gasket release system for a secure cooking experience. The ultra-hygienic, mirror-finish inner surface prevents food from sticking and does not affect the color or taste of your food, making cleanup effortless. Ideal for both everyday use and special occasions, this pressure cooker promises convenience and reliability in every kitchen.', '2024-07-11 14:24:42', '2024-07-11 14:24:42', 36, 0),
(122, ' Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Splendid Plus Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Vinod 18/8 Stainless Steel Splendid Plus Pressure Cooker is crafted in India to the highest quality standards, ensuring durability and exceptional performance. Designed to streamline your cooking process, it allows you to steam fresh vegetables, and prepare rice, dal, and meat dishes in minutes, all while sealing in flavor and nutrients.\r\n\r\nFeaturing an innovative sandwich bottom with aluminum encapsulated stainless steel SAS technology, it guarantees even cooking and prevents food from burning. The Gasket Release System and fusible safety valve provide maximum safety during use. Made from ultra-hygienic, food-grade stainless steel with a perfect mirror finish, it ensures food doesn\'t stick and maintains the purity of taste.\r\n\r\nAcidic foods like tamarind and tomatoes won\'t corrode the stainless steel, ensuring contamination-free cooking. The ergonomic handle offers a comfortable and firm grip, and the cooker is compatible with both induction and gas stoves. This versatile and reliable pressure cooker comes with a 24-month warranty, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-11 14:26:55', '2024-07-11 14:26:55', 36, 0),
(123, 'Vinod Platinum Triply Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Experience the excellence of the Vinod Platinum Triply Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker, meticulously crafted using SAS technology. This innovative construction features three layers: AISI 304 food-grade stainless steel on the inside for rust-free, hygienic cooking; a middle layer of aluminum for even heat distribution; and an outer layer of 430-grade magnetic stainless steel, making it compatible with both induction and gas stoves.\r\n\r\nThe cooker is designed for energy-efficient and nutritious cooking, ensuring your meals are prepared quickly and healthily. The comfortable handles make it easy to hold and maneuver, reducing time spent in the kitchen. Its perfectly matte-finished inner surface prevents food from sticking and retains the natural color, taste, and odor of your dishes.\r\n\r\nIdeal for cooking a variety of meals such as dal, rice, khichdi, vegetables, and meat dishes, this pressure cooker also ensures contamination-free cooking, even with acidic foods like tamarind and tomatoes. Enhance your cooking experience with the Vinod Platinum Triply Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker, a reliable and efficient addition to any kitchen.', '2024-07-11 14:30:01', '2024-07-11 14:30:01', 36, 0),
(124, 'Kraft Hard Anodised Inner Lid Pressure Cooker', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Kraft Hard Anodised Inner Lid Pressure Cooker from Vinod Cookware is your ultimate kitchen companion this monsoon. Engineered with hard anodised virgin aluminium, it ensures durability and resistance to abrasion and corrosion. This pressure cooker retains nutrients, promoting healthier meals. Its ergonomic heat-resistant handles fit comfortably in your palm for safe handling. Compatible with both gas stoves and induction cooktops, it offers versatile cooking options. The fusible safety valve guarantees a secure cooking experience. Cook a variety of dishes, from dal to meat, in minutes. Enjoy up to 25% off sitewide and flat 30% off on select products today!', '2024-08-04 13:39:45', '2024-08-04 13:39:45', 36, 0),
(125, 'Kraft Aluminum Classic Inner Lid Pressure Cooker (Induction Friendly)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Kraft Aluminum Classic Inner Lid Pressure Cooker by Vinod Cookware is a kitchen essential designed with precision and quality. Crafted from superior virgin aluminium, it ensures safety, longevity, and resistance to corrosion and odors. Its heat-resistant handles are ergonomically designed to fit comfortably in your palm, providing secure handling. The fusible metallic safety valve guarantees a safe cooking experience. This pressure cooker reduces cooking time, making even elaborate recipes quick and easy. Its uniform heat distribution is perfect for cooking meats, vegetables, dals, curries, and more. Compatible with both induction and gas stoves, it\'s versatile for all households. Elevate your cooking with this durable, elegant pressure cooker. Enjoy up to 25% off sitewide and flat 30% off on select products!\r\nBy vinod intelligent cookware', '2024-08-04 13:43:13', '2024-08-04 13:43:13', 36, 0),
(127, 'Kraft Stylo Aluminium Inner Lid Pressure Cooker (Induction Friendly)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'The Kraft Stylo Aluminium Inner Lid Pressure Cooker by Vinod Cookware is designed for modern kitchens, combining durability with elegance. Made from superior virgin aluminium, this pressure cooker is safe, long-lasting, and resistant to corrosion and odors. Its heat-resistant handles are ergonomically designed for a comfortable grip. The fusible metallic safety valve ensures a secure cooking experience. Its wide base facilitates uniform heat distribution, reducing cooking time and allowing easy stirring of ingredients. Ideal for cooking a variety of dishes such as meats, vegetables, dals, curries, and more, it is compatible with both induction and gas stoves. Upgrade your cooking with this versatile and efficient pressure cooker. Take advantage of our Monsoon offer with up to 25% off sitewide and flat 30% off on select products!', '2024-08-04 13:45:21', '2024-08-04 13:45:21', 36, 0),
(128, 'Philips Digital XL size 6.2 Litres Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology', 16995, 12495, 4500, 'The Philips Digital XL 6.2 Litres Airfryer (HD9270/70) offers a healthier way to fry, using Rapid Air Technology to make food crispy on the outside and tender on the inside. This versatile appliance allows you to fry, bake, grill, roast, and even reheat meals. Its XL size is perfect for families, accommodating up to 1.2 kg of food. The digital interface provides easy control over time and temperature. With the NutriU app, you can access hundreds of delicious recipes tailored to your airfryer. Easy to clean with dishwasher-safe parts, it combines convenience with healthy cooking.', '2024-08-10 06:59:03', '2024-08-10 06:59:03', 37, 0),
(132, 'EDGE PRO 3Burner Gas Stove', 12639, 7990, 4849, 'Since 1978, Maya Appliances has been a trusted name in kitchen appliances under the Preethi brand. In 2011, the company transitioned to a new chapter with Vidiem, showcasing cutting-edge kitchen technology. The Vidiem Edge Pro 3 Burner Glass Cooktop features an extra-large cooking surface with widely spaced burners designed for large vessels, including jumbo, medium, and small brass burners. It includes 10mm thermally treated toughened glass for durability, heavy-duty Duro Forged brass burners, and direct flow gas tubes to prevent blockages. The cooktop also offers removable, spill-proof drip trays for easy cleaning and a 100% rustproof powder-coated GI panel. With precision gas valves for safety, high efficiency, 5mm thick pan supports, and sturdy engineering plastic knobs, it comes with a lifetime warranty on the glass and a 2-year warranty on the product. Each Vidiem stove undergoes rigorous leak, life, load, and drop tests to ensure superior safety, reliability, and performance.', '2024-08-11 04:40:12', '2024-08-11 04:40:12', 38, 0),
(133, 'AIR SILVER 4Burner Gas Stove', 14695, 9290, 5405, 'Vidiem AIR Silver Frameless Glass Cooktop (Patent Pending): Combining elegance with durability, this cooktop features an extra-large cooking surface and widely spaced burners to accommodate large vessels, including jumbo, medium, and small brass burners. It comes with a lifetime warranty on the glass and a 2-year warranty on the product. Each Vidiem cooktop undergoes rigorous leak, life, load, and drop tests to ensure superior safety, reliability, durability, and performance.\r\n\r\nKey Product Features:\r\n\r\n10mm thermally treated toughened glass for long-lasting use.\r\nHeavy-duty brass burners and mixing tubes designed for Indian cooking.\r\nDirect flow gas tubes to prevent ant and dust blockages.\r\nRemovable, spill-proof drip trays for easy cleaning.\r\nPrecision gas valves for safety and efficiency.\r\nRustproof vitreous enameled pan supports with sturdy engineering plastic knobs.\r\nQuality Guaranteed since 1978: Maya Appliances, founded in 1978, originally marketed kitchen appliances under the Preethi brand. In 2011, the company evolved to introduce Vidiem, a new chapter of innovative kitchen solutions.', '2024-08-11 04:45:05', '2024-08-11 04:45:05', 38, 0),
(134, 'SUJATA MG02- Black 1000W Mixer Grinder (3 Jars, Black)', 9225, 6890, 2335, 'Warranty: 2-year warranty provided by the manufacturer from the date of purchase.\r\n\r\nIncludes:\r\n\r\n1 unit motor\r\n1 wet grinder jar\r\n1 chutney jar\r\n1 dry grinder jar\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nPowerful Motor: 1000 watts with double ball bearings for enhanced efficiency, low maintenance, and long-lasting performance.\r\nVersatile Jars: Includes a dome jar for wet grinding and two separate stainless steel jars for dry grinding and chutney preparation.\r\nHigh-Speed Operation: 22,000 RPM to preserve the flavor and aroma of juices and food.\r\nExtended Usage: Capable of continuous operation for up to 90 minutes, ideal for extended use.\r\nSafety: Shock-proof and designed for safe operation.\r\nMaintenance: Low maintenance with trouble-free running for years.', '2024-08-11 05:02:53', '2024-08-11 05:02:53', 22, 0),
(135, 'Havells Induction Glass Ceramic Cooktop Tc20 With 9 Cooking Modes Bis Approved 2000 Watt With 3 Year Coil Warranty - Black', 6095, 4188, 1907, 'Efficient & Powerful 2000W for Faster Cooking.\r\nEnjoy rapid cooking with a high-performance 2000W power output.\r\n\r\nExtended Warranty Coverage.\r\nBenefit from a 3-year coil warranty and a 1-year product warranty with onsite service.\r\n\r\nBIS Certified with R Mark Approval.\r\nAssured safety and quality with BIS approval and R mark certification.\r\n\r\nUser-Friendly Feather Touch Panel.\r\nEasily control your cooking settings with an intuitive feather touch interface.\r\n\r\nSmart Auto Pan Detection with Auto Power Off.\r\nAutomatically detects the pan and powers off when no pan is present, ensuring energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nVersatile Cooking Options.\r\nChoose from 9 preset cooking modes, offering both fixed and variable cooking features.\r\n\r\nLow Maintenance Ceramic Glass Plate.\r\nHassle-free cleaning with a durable ceramic glass plate that’s easy to maintain.\r\n\r\nConvenient 3-Hour Timer.\r\nSet your cooking duration up to 3 hours with the built-in timer function.\r\nEnhanced Safety with Automatic Overheat Protection.\r\nStay safe with automatic protection that activates at higher temperatures.\r\n\r\nAdvanced Digital LED Display.\r\nEasily monitor your cooking with a clear digital LED indicator, featuring a child lock function for added security.', '2024-08-12 09:44:22', '2024-08-12 09:53:23', 40, 0),
(136, 'LG 32 L Convection Microwave Oven (MC3286BRUM, Black, 360° Motorised Rotisserie & Diet Fry)', 23999, 17990, 6009, 'Convection Oven for Versatile Cooking\r\nPerfect for baking, grilling, reheating, defrosting, and cooking, with a maximum temperature setting to suit all your culinary needs.\r\n\r\nSpacious 32-Litre Capacity\r\nIdeal for families of 4-6 members. Note: This product does not include a starter kit.\r\n\r\nComprehensive Manufacturer Warranty\r\nEnjoy peace of mind with a 1-year warranty on the product from the date of purchase (T&C Apply).\r\n\r\nAdvanced Control Panel & Baking Functions\r\nEasily navigate through multiple cooking programs including Micro, Grill/Combination, Convection, Diet Fry/Low Calorie, Tandoor Se, Kid’s Delight, Indian Roti Basket, Indian Cuisine, Paneer/Curd, Cooking Aid/Steam Clean, Tea/Dairy Delight, and Dosa/Ghee. Features include Stop/Clear and Start buttons.\r\n\r\nEfficient Energy Consumption\r\n\r\nConvection Power Consumption: 2400W\r\nGrill Power Consumption: 1250W\r\nPower Output: 900W\r\nMicrowave Power Levels: 5 adjustable levels\r\nExtensive 301 Auto Cook Menu\r\nEnjoy a variety of recipes, including:\r\n\r\nBreakfast Options: Wheat Rawa Idli, Chana Dal Pancake, Moong Daal Cheela, Spinach and Paneer Toasts\r\nHealthy Lunch: Methi Missi Roti, Grilled Veggies (Zucchini & Carrot), Soya Bhurji\r\nHealthy Snacks: Ragi Pizza, Soya Milk, Pasta\r\nSpecial Delicacies: Paneer/Chicken Tikka, Pulao, Flaxseeds Soup, Brown Rice Daliya, Roasted Garlic/Flaxseeds\r\nSpecial Features for Enhanced Cooking\r\n\r\nGhee in 12 Minutes: Make hygienic ghee with no smell in just 12 minutes (*time may vary by model).\r\nDiet Fry: High on taste, light on calories.\r\nRoti Basket: Easily make rotis at home (*patent applied for).\r\nMotorized Rotisserie: Enjoy hassle-free barbecuing at home with a 360° motorized rotisserie for crispy, tasty results.\r\nAdditional Features\r\n\r\nStainless Steel Cavity: Ensures hygiene and durability.\r\nPasteurized Milk Function: Retains nutrition while removing bacteria.\r\nAuto Cook Menu: Surprise your family with new dishes every day.\r\nDoor Type: Side swing.\r\nSafety Features: Child lock, completion beeper, and timed cooking.\r\nControl Type: Tact dial, with defrost and programmable settings.\r\nDimensions\r\n\r\nOuter Body: 53 x 32.2 x 53.3 cm (W x H x D)\r\nInner Cavity: Stainless steel\r\nTurntable Diameter: 13.38 inches\r\nIn the Box\r\nIncludes 1 microwave oven, owner’s manual, recipe manual, cookbook, shelf, milk container, rotisserie bar and handle, glass tray, tawa, and rotating ring.', '2024-08-13 12:05:14', '2024-08-13 12:05:14', 18, 0),
(137, 'Philips HD6975/00 Digital Oven Toaster Grill, 25 Litre OTG, 1500 Watt with Opti Temp Technology, Chamber light and 10 preset menus, Inner Lamp (Grey)', 9595, 8795, 800, 'This 25-litre capacity oven, powered by 1500 watts, operates at a voltage range of 220-240 volts with a frequency of 50/60 Hz. It features Opti Temp Technology, ensuring uniform cooking and even browning on all sides of your food, particularly in bread and cakes, eliminating dark spots for perfect results every time. With a one-touch 10 preset menu, you can easily select from modes like Toast, Bagel, Pizza, Bake, Broil, Cookies, Roast, Grill, Tikka, and Preheat, each pre-programmed with the optimal time, temperature, and heating element settings to deliver expert results.\r\n\r\nThe oven\'s pre-heat mode prepares the appliance for perfect baking and cooking, supported by a 90-minute auto cut-off for added safety. For those who love perfectly browned dishes, the motorized rotisserie function, equipped with a rust-free rotisserie rod, ensures ideal results every time. The double glass door enhances heat retention and safety, while the heating elements have been tested for 600 hours of endurance, ensuring long-lasting performance.\r\n\r\nAccessories included are a baking tray, grill rack, tong, crumb tray, and skewer rods, with a chamber light for easy viewing. The timer ranges from 0 to 90 minutes with 1-minute intervals, and the temperature can be precisely adjusted between 65 to 230°C in 5-degree increments. To top it off, the product comes with a 2-year warranty, offering peace of mind with your purchase.', '2024-08-13 12:17:18', '2024-08-13 12:24:41', 17, 0),
(138, 'Wonderchef Regenta Espresso Coffee Machine, 19-bar, Make Espressos, Cappuccinos & Lattes at Home, With Steamer, Metal Porta Filter, Temperature Dial, 2 Year Warranty', 15000, 8999, 6001, 'The Regenta 19-bar Coffee Maker is a powerful espresso machine designed to extract essential oils from coffee powder, delivering a rich and aromatic brew with every use. Whether you prefer your espresso straight or enjoy crafting cappuccinos and lattes, the machine’s steamer offers versatility for all coffee lovers. \r\n\r\nWith a 19-bar pressure pump, this espresso maker ensures precise and consistent extraction, resulting in espresso shots topped with a rich crema for an indulgent coffee experience. Its superior build quality, featuring a die-cast aluminum alloy boiler, metal porta filter, steam frother, stainless steel body, and a transparent water tank, guarantees excellent performance while adding a stylish touch to your kitchen or coffee station.\r\n\r\nThe traditional-style analog dial adds a classic feel to the machine, helping you maintain the optimal temperature for perfectly brewed coffee. It\'s also easy to use, with a green light and temperature dial guiding you on when to extract your coffee or steam your cappuccino. Additionally, the keep-warm plate at the top keeps your cups warm, enhancing your coffee ritual.\r\n\r\nDesigned for fine-ground coffee, the metal porta filter ensures smooth and consistent results, catering to the coffee connoisseur in you. The specially crafted steam tube frother adds the perfect amount of froth to your beverages, making every cup not only delicious but also visually appealing.', '2024-08-16 09:45:11', '2024-08-16 09:45:11', 30, 0),
(139, 'Philips Drip Coffee Maker HD7432/20, 0.6 L, Ideal for 2-7 cups, 750W, Black, Medium', 3895, 3399, 496, 'The Philips HD7432/20 Coffee Maker is a compact and efficient appliance that brews 2 to 7 cups of coffee in just 10 minutes, making it perfect for small kitchens with limited space. It features a water level indicator for easy filling and an Aroma Twister nozzle that circulates the coffee evenly, ensuring a consistent and optimal aroma from the first to the last cup.\r\n\r\nThe coffee maker\'s drip-stop feature allows you to interrupt the brewing process at any time, giving you more control over your coffee-making experience. It also includes an illuminated power switch for added convenience. Cleaning and maintenance are hassle-free, as the glass jug and filter holder are dishwasher-safe. Additionally, the coffee maker comes with a 2-year warranty for peace of mind.', '2024-08-16 10:02:45', '2024-08-16 10:02:45', 30, 0),
(140, 'PHILIPS Latte Go Fully Automatic Bean to Cup Espresso Coffee Machine, 3 one touch button coffees (Cappuccino, Black coffee, Espresso),15 bars,Ceramic Grinder- 2 year brand warranty - EP2230/10', 79990, 71999, 7991, 'Enjoy three popular coffee recipes with just one touch using this versatile coffee maker, offering classic espresso, regular black coffee, and cappuccino—all with perfect crema, rich aroma, and the ideal temperature. It also provides hot water for tea lovers.\r\n\r\nWith an intuitive touch screen display featuring colored icons, selecting and customizing your favorite drinks is effortless. The My Coffee Choice function allows you to adjust the coffee strength, length, and milk froth level to suit your taste.\r\n\r\nThe LatteGo milk system prepares silky smooth milk froth at the touch of a button, thanks to its advanced cyclonic frothing technology, which works seamlessly with both dairy and plant-based milk alternatives. Not only does it deliver perfect froth, but it’s also the fastest milk system to clean, with just two parts and no tubes, and can even be stored in the refrigerator.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the AquaClean filter ensures clear and purified water, and with proper maintenance, you won\'t need to descale your machine for up to 5,000 cups, making it both convenient and long-lasting.', '2024-08-16 10:15:34', '2024-08-16 10:15:34', 30, 0),
(141, 'PHILIPS Fully Automatic Bean to Cup Espresso Coffee Machine with Milk Frother - EP3221/40, with coffees at touch of a button (Espresso, Black Coffee, Lungo, Americano) and 2 year brand warranty', 69990, 62999, 6991, 'Enjoy four aromatic coffee options for your special moments, whether you\'re in the mood for espresso, regular coffee, or a milk-based recipe. This fully automatic machine delivers a perfect in-cup result with no hassle and in no time.\r\n\r\nEquipped with 100% ceramic grinders, the machine brings out the full flavor and aroma of your coffee beans. These durable, sharp-edged grinders are designed to last for at least 20,000 cups, ensuring consistent quality with every brew.\r\n\r\nThe Classic Milk Frother makes preparing silky smooth milk froth for your cappuccinos effortless. With only two parts, it’s also simple to clean, adding to your convenience.\r\n\r\nThe intuitive touch display allows you to easily select your favorite coffee at the press of a button, bringing the irresistible taste and aroma of freshly ground beans straight to your cup.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the AquaClean filter ensures clear, purified water, and with proper maintenance, you won\'t need to descale your machine for up to 5,000 cups, making it both efficient and easy to maintain.', '2024-08-16 10:25:39', '2024-08-16 10:25:39', 30, 0),
(142, 'Morphy Richards Kaffeto 1350 W Milk Frother and Coffee Maker', 33995, 14999, 18996, 'This 3-in-1 Coffee Maker offers versatility by brewing espresso, lattes, and cappuccinos, complete with milk frothing for a range of delicious drinks. Featuring a removable filter, it simplifies your brewing experience. With one-touch operation, you can effortlessly switch between espresso, latte, and cappuccino for both small and large cups.\r\n\r\nFor easy cleaning, both the 700 ml milk tank and 1200 ml water tank are dishwasher-safe. The machine operates with powerful 15-bar pressure, ensuring a rich and flavorful coffee taste every time. Advanced technology, including a flowmeter and temperature control, ensures precise coffee extraction at the perfect temperature. Note that this coffee maker is designed exclusively for ground espresso coffee powder and is not compatible with coffee beans.', '2024-08-16 10:47:52', '2024-08-16 10:47:52', 30, 0),
(143, 'Morphy Richards Impresso Coffee Making Machine|Upto 20 Bar Pressure Rich Espresso Coffee Maker|Milk Frothing Nozzle|Push Button Operation|Removable Drip Tray|2-Yr Warranty By Brand|Black & Steel', 18595, 9499, 9096, 'This Espresso Coffee Maker, with up to 20 bars of pressure and 1100 watts of power, delivers rich, full-bodied flavor in every cup. Backed by a 2-year warranty, it offers peace of mind and reliability. The built-in milk frother allows you to create frothy lattes and professional-grade cappuccinos right at home.\r\n\r\nWith a convenient one-button operation, you can easily brew single or double shots of espresso. Cleaning is hassle-free thanks to the removable drip tray, making it simple to maintain your machine. Designed for use with ground coffee powder, it lets you unleash your inner barista. For added support, Morphy Richards Consumer Care is available for warranty and service inquiries.', '2024-08-16 11:34:43', '2024-08-16 11:34:43', 30, 0),
(144, 'Regenta Fully Automatic Coffee Machine | For brewing Americano, Cappuccino, Latte, Macchiato, Flat White, Espresso | Bean-To-Cup Coffee at 19 bar pressure', 100000, 69999, 30001, 'The Wonderchef Regenta Fully Automatic Coffee Machine offers a one-touch coffee experience, delivering the perfect espresso, cappuccino, latte, or any coffee you desire. This bean-to-cup machine grinds the beans and froths the milk automatically, allowing you to enjoy a complete coffee experience at the touch of a button.\r\n\r\nWith a sleek digital display, you can easily navigate through the intuitive menu on the HD touch screen to choose from a wide selection of coffee options such as Espresso, Americano, Cappuccino, and Latte. The machine pairs perfectly with Wonderchef coffee, known for its medium-dark roast, bold flavor, and full-bodied richness. A complimentary sample of this high-quality coffee, made from naturally sourced beans, is included with the machine.\r\n\r\nOperation is simple—just add your coffee beans, and the machine handles the rest. It grinds the beans, extracts a rich espresso shot, dispenses and froths the milk, and blends it to deliver the perfect cup of coffee every time. The Italian pump, with high 19-bar pressure, ensures a perfect espresso shot topped with a thick, golden crema for a rich and flavorful experience.\r\n\r\nThanks to the double thermo-block feature, the machine offers faster and more uniform heating, with separate heating blocks for the coffee and steamer, ensuring precise and consistent brewing. The conical burr grinder guarantees a consistent grind for superior taste and aroma.\r\n\r\nCleaning is effortless—simply press a button, and the machine cleans itself, saving you time and effort. Backed by Italian-inspired design and German-quality standards, Wonderchef products come with a reliable on-site warranty for peace of mind. T&Cs apply.', '2024-08-16 11:53:47', '2024-08-16 11:53:47', 30, 0),
(145, 'Morphy Richards Windsor Series Digital 2 Slice 800W Pop Up Toaster | 8-Browning Levels | Reheat & Defrost | Wide Bread Slots | Bun Warmer | Dust Cover | Removable Crumb Tray|2-Yr Warranty By Brand | Black,800 Watts', 5995, 3280, 2715, 'This digital pop-up toaster, with a capacity of 2 slices, operates at 800 watts with a rated voltage of 230 volts and a frequency of 50 Hz. Its sleek black design makes it a stylish addition to any modern kitchen. Backed by a 2-year warranty from Morphy Richards (T&C Applied), this toaster combines modern features with convenience. The Windsor series digital kettle includes a digital display and touch controls, offering precise control over your toasting experience. You can monitor the exact time left for toasting and select your preferred browning level from 8 different options, all at the touch of a button. Beyond just toasting, the toaster offers reheat and defrost functions for optimal browning, and a convenient cancel button to stop the toasting cycle whenever needed.\r\n\r\nEquipped with a warming rack, this versatile toaster allows you to warm buns, croissants, and other breads effortlessly. The bread centering feature ensures uniform browning, while the removable crumb tray makes cleaning easy. It also includes a dust cover to keep it clean and an inbuilt cord winder for tidy storage. Additionally, its wide slots allow you to toast various types of bread, making it more than just a standard toaster. For any warranty issues or service needs, Morphy Richards’ Consumer Care is readily available to assist.', '2024-08-19 06:43:39', '2024-08-19 06:43:39', 29, 0),
(146, 'Morphy Richards at 402 1450Watts Pop-Up Toaster, 4-Slice Automatic Pop up Toaster with Removable Crumb Tray, 7-Levels Browning Controls, Bread Centering with Wide Bread Slots, 2-Yr Warranty, White', 4595, 2450, 2145, 'This 4-slice toaster operates at 1450 watts, providing quick and efficient toasting. Designed with wider slots, it accommodates both thick and thin slices of bread, allowing you to toast multiple pieces at once, making it convenient and time-saving. The toaster features a removable crumb tray for easy cleaning and a bread centering guide that holds the bread in the center for uniform browning. With the hi-lift function and auto pop-up feature, removing bread of all sizes is simple and safe. The variable browning control lets you choose the perfect level of toasting, with options to cancel, reheat, or defrost bread at any browning level. For added safety, the cool-touch body ensures carefree toasting. Its long body design is space-saving, allowing it to fit seamlessly into any kitchen. This toaster is backed by a 2-year product warranty and includes a toaster unit, instruction manual, and warranty card. Additionally, purchases made between October 1st and November 30th, 2021, are eligible for a 6-month extended warranty, subject to product registration on the Morphy Richards India website by December 7th, 2021. Terms and conditions apply.', '2024-08-19 07:45:52', '2024-08-19 07:45:52', 29, 0),
(147, 'Prestige Svachh Hard Anodised Spillage Control Pressure Cooker, 3.5 L (Black)', 2660, 3130, 470, 'The Prestige Svachh Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker is designed with innovative spill control technology, ensuring a mess-free cooking experience. Its durable anodised surface guarantees long-lasting performance while being induction and gas compatible. The unique lid effectively prevents spillage, maintaining a clean kitchen. Featuring a mini metallic safety plug and controlled gasket release system, it ensures enhanced safety. The robust handles offer a firm grip, making it easy to use. With a 3.5 L capacity, this cooker is perfect for medium-sized families. It\'s compatible with all heat sources, including induction. The anti-bulge base enhances its sturdiness and durability. This cooker includes a 5-year warranty, giving you peace of mind. Cooking has never been so efficient and safe!', '2024-08-23 15:06:05', '2024-08-23 15:06:05', 36, 4),
(148, 'Prestige Svachh Flip-On Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker with Glass Lid, 3 Litre (Black)', 4170, 4900, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Svachh Flip-On Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker, designed for modern households. With its 3-litre capacity, this innovative pressure cooker ensures spillage-free cooking, making your kitchen cleaner and safer. The unique flip-on lid allows for easy locking and unlocking, reducing the risk of accidents. Its hard-anodized body ensures even heat distribution, improving cooking efficiency. Compatible with both gas and induction stoves, this versatile cooker is built for convenience. The toughened glass lid lets you monitor cooking without losing heat. Backed by a 5-year warranty, this cooker combines performance with peace of mind. Cook, steam, and serve with ease using this multipurpose kitchen essential. Embrace hassle-free, healthy cooking every day with Prestige.', '2024-08-23 15:35:48', '2024-08-23 15:35:48', 36, 4),
(149, 'Prestige Svachh Hard Anodised Spillage Control Senior Pressure Cooker, 5 L (Black)', 3180, 3740, NULL, 'The Prestige Svachh Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker, 5L, combines functionality with modern design, offering the perfect solution for mess-free cooking. Featuring a unique lid to prevent spillage, this pressure cooker keeps your kitchen clean. Its hard-anodized body ensures faster and even heating, making it highly efficient. The anti-bulge induction base works seamlessly on both gas and induction stoves. The durable handles provide a comfortable grip while cooking. Designed for safety, the mini metallic safety plug and controlled gasket release system ensure worry-free usage. Elevate your culinary experience with this Prestige innovation, backed by a 5-year warranty. Ideal for large families, it makes meal preparation faster, cleaner, and healthier.', '2024-08-23 15:52:53', '2024-08-23 15:52:53', 36, 4),
(150, 'Prestige Nakshatra Plus Svachh Hard Anodised Aluminium Spillage Control Handi Pressure Cooker (Black)', 2025, 1720, 305, 'This Prestige Nakshatra Plus Svachh Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker brings unparalleled durability and cleanliness to your kitchen. Its unique deep lid prevents messy spillage, ensuring a tidy cooking experience. Made from superior hard anodised aluminium, it is both gas and induction compatible. The anti-bulge induction base ensures even cooking on various heat sources. Designed with sturdy, heat-resistant handles for easy handling. The cooker features a metallic safety plug and inner lid for maximum safety during use. A 5-year warranty covers its long-lasting performance. Ideal for making a variety of dishes like biryani, curries, and soups. Compact and space-saving, this cooker is perfect for modern kitchens. Its sleek black finish adds a touch of elegance to your cookware collection.', '2024-08-25 07:07:29', '2024-08-25 07:07:29', 36, 4),
(151, 'Prestige Deluxe Duo Plus Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker with 1 Glass Lid and 1 Stainless Steel Lid, 3 L (Black)', 3030, 2580, NULL, 'The Prestige Deluxe Duo Plus Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker is a versatile addition to your kitchen. With a 3-liter capacity, it comes equipped with a durable hard anodised body, a stainless steel lid, and a glass lid with a ladle holder. Designed for gas and induction compatibility, this pressure cooker ensures even heat distribution for efficient cooking. The built-in safety features, including a pressure indicator, safety plug, and controlled gasket release system, provide peace of mind during use. Perfect for daily cooking, its stylish black finish adds elegance to any kitchen. Five-year warranty included for long-lasting reliability.', '2024-08-25 07:19:12', '2024-08-25 07:19:12', 36, 4);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `original_price`, `offer_price`, `discount`, `description`, `created`, `modified`, `category_id`, `company_id`) VALUES
(152, 'Prestige Deluxe Plus Hard Anodised Mini Handi Pressure Cooker, 3L (Black)', 2880, 2450, NULL, 'Experience traditional Indian cooking with the Prestige Deluxe Plus Hard Anodised Mini Handi Pressure Cooker. This 3-litre black cooker combines the timeless handi shape with modern pressure cooking technology for rich flavors and efficient cooking. Crafted with a durable hard-anodized body and an induction-compatible bottom, it ensures fast, even heating. The comfortable handles and metallic safety plug offer added safety during use. Perfect for both stovetop and induction cooking, this cooker also features a controlled GRS system. Enjoy reliable performance backed by a 5-year warranty. Elevate your kitchen with this versatile and high-quality pressure cooker, ideal for daily cooking.', '2024-08-25 07:24:53', '2024-08-25 07:24:53', 36, 4),
(153, 'Prestige Clip-on Mini Svachh Hard Anodised Handi Pressure Cooker with Glass Lid, 3 L (Black)', 4180, 3550, NULL, 'The Prestige Clip-on Mini Svachh Handi Pressure Cooker offers unmatched convenience with its unique spillage control feature. Made from hard anodised material, it ensures durability and long-lasting performance. The universal deep lid design prevents messes in the kitchen, while the toughened glass lid adds a touch of modern style. Its 3-liter capacity is perfect for family meals, and the heat-resistant handles make it safe to handle. Compatible with both gas and induction stoves, this cooker is versatile and efficient. Enjoy the benefits of sautéing, frying, boiling, and more all in one pot. With 5 years of warranty and the highest safety standards, this pressure cooker is your kitchen\'s perfect companion.', '2024-08-25 07:31:41', '2024-08-25 07:31:41', 36, 4),
(154, 'Prestige Svachh Flip-on Mini Stainless Steel Spillage Control Pressure Cooker with Glass Lid, 2 Litre (Silver)', 4250, 3610, NULL, 'Experience a cleaner, safer kitchen with the Prestige Svachh Flip-on Mini Pressure Cooker. Its innovative spillage control lid ensures your cooking stays mess-free, while the toughened glass lid doubles as a serve-ware. Crafted from durable stainless steel with a tri-ply bottom for even heat distribution, it works efficiently on both gas and induction stoves. Enjoy safe cooking with a built-in pressure indicator and ergonomic handle. Perfect for small families, this 2-litre cooker is backed by a 5-year warranty, offering reliable performance for years to come. Ideal for steaming, sautéing, and pressure cooking.', '2024-08-25 07:38:40', '2024-08-25 07:38:40', 36, 4),
(155, 'Prestige Popular Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker Combi Pack 3 + 2 Litre with Outer Lid', 3695, 2400, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Popular Stainless Steel Pressure Cooker Combi Pack. This combo includes a 3-litre and a 2-litre pressure cooker, both featuring an outer lid that fits snugly on either size. Made from high-quality stainless steel, these pressure cookers are induction and gas stove compatible. Durable handles ensure a firm grip, while the sturdy construction guarantees longevity. This set is perfect for those who value efficiency and versatility in the kitchen. With a 5-year warranty, enjoy hassle-free cooking with Prestige\'s trusted safety features. Ideal for everyday use and designed for a modern kitchen.', '2024-08-25 07:52:43', '2024-08-25 07:52:43', 36, 4),
(156, 'Prestige Popular Svachh Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker 5.0 L', 2650, 2250, NULL, 'Experience the ease of cooking with the Prestige Popular Svachh Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker, featuring a 5.0 L capacity. Designed for safety and efficiency, this cooker prevents spillage with its unique Deep-lid design, while the hard anodized body ensures durability and even heat distribution. Ideal for Indian kitchens, it features a metallic safety plug and gasket-release system for enhanced safety. Compatible with both gas stoves, this ISI-certified pressure cooker offers a hassle-free cooking experience. Its 5-year warranty guarantees long-lasting performance. Elevate your cooking game with Prestige’s innovation and craftsmanship.', '2024-08-25 09:12:11', '2024-08-25 09:12:11', 36, 4),
(157, 'Prestige Popular Stainless Steel Combo', 4975, 3499, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Popular Stainless Steel Combo, featuring a 3L Svachh Pressure Cooker, a 2.25L Kadai, and a 1.9L Fry Pan. Engineered for convenience and safety, the pressure cooker comes with an induction-compatible base, a controlled gasket-release system, and spill-control technology. The Kadai and Fry Pan feature an impact-forged bottom for even heat distribution and soft-touch, heat-resistant handles for safe cooking. Perfect for gas and induction stoves, the stainless steel construction ensures durability. With a 5-year warranty, it\'s a long-lasting addition to any kitchen. Cook fast, fry evenly, and keep your kitchen clean with this energy-efficient combo!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '2024-08-25 09:26:15', '2024-08-25 09:26:15', 36, 4),
(158, 'Prestige Microchef Microwave Pressure Cooker PMPC 4.0, 4 Litres – Speedy Cooking, Maximum Nutrition', 1495, 1270, NULL, 'The Prestige Microchef Microwave Pressure Cooker revolutionizes your kitchen routine by combining microwave speed with traditional pressure cooking efficiency. Cook faster and healthier meals while preserving nutrition and flavor. Made from food-grade microwavable plastic, this cooker ensures safe and uniform cooking every time. Perfect for busy families, it retains color, nutrients, and the delicious taste of your favorite dishes. With its ergonomic design and highest safety standards, it’s easy to use and a game changer for modern kitchens. Ideal for steaming and cooking, this compact cooker is a must-have.', '2024-08-25 09:40:10', '2024-08-25 09:40:10', 36, 4),
(159, 'Prestige Nakshatra Svachh Aluminium Inner Lid Pressure Cooker (8 L)', 2575, 2190, NULL, 'The Prestige Nakshatra Svachh 8L Pressure Cooker is the perfect addition to your kitchen for fast, safe, and spill-free cooking. Featuring a unique deep lid, this pressure cooker ensures that any spillage is contained, keeping your stovetop clean. Crafted from durable aluminium, it offers compatibility with both gas and induction cooktops. The anti-bulge base ensures uniform heating, while the metallic safety plug adds an extra layer of protection. With sturdy handles and a sleek design, it provides ease of use and convenience. Ideal for large families, its 8-liter capacity can handle bulk cooking. Backed by a 5-year manufacturer warranty, it guarantees long-lasting performance. Cook healthier meals with ease and efficiency. Enjoy free shipping on orders above ₹750.', '2024-08-25 09:59:03', '2024-08-25 09:59:03', 36, 4),
(160, 'Prestige Deluxe Plus Aluminium Pressure Baby Handi 2 Litre - Silver', 1960, 1670, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige Deluxe Plus Aluminium Pressure Baby Handi, a versatile 2-litre pressure cooker designed for modern kitchens. Its durable induction base ensures compatibility with any heat source, while the heavier body and controlled GRS offer enhanced safety and performance. The double screw handles are built for durability and easy handling. Equipped with a pressure indicator, this outer lid pressure handi cooks delicious meals with precision. Perfect for small families, its compact design adds a traditional touch to your kitchen. Experience fast, even cooking with safety features like the fusible safety plug. Ideal for rice, curries, and more.', '2024-08-25 10:17:11', '2024-08-25 10:17:11', 36, 4),
(161, 'Prestige Popular Plus 7.5 L Virgin Aluminium Pressure Cooker - Induction & Gas Compatible', 3210, 2889, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Popular Plus Pressure Cooker, crafted from premium virgin aluminium for zero contamination cooking. Designed for both gas and induction cooktops, this 7.5-liter cooker ensures faster, safer, and healthier meals. Featuring a precision weight valve, metallic safety plug, and gasket-release system, it offers the highest standards of safety and reliability. Its sleek, straight design adds a touch of elegance to your kitchen while providing ample space for larger dishes. With a 5-year warranty, you can cook confidently with a durable, innovative, and trustworthy cooker by Prestige.', '2024-08-25 10:23:05', '2024-08-25 10:23:05', 36, 4),
(162, 'Prestige Apple Duo Plus Hard Anodised Spillage Control Pressure Cooker (Black)', 2040, 1836, NULL, 'The Prestige Apple Duo Plus Hard Anodised Pressure Cooker is designed for seamless cooking with spillage control technology. Its unique deep stainless steel lid prevents food from spilling, ensuring a cleaner kitchen. This cooker is built with a durable hard-anodised body, offering long-lasting performance. It is compatible with both gas and induction cooktops, making it versatile for all kitchens. The metallic safety plug adds an extra layer of safety, while its sturdy handle ensures a comfortable grip. With a 5-year warranty, this pressure cooker promises reliability and peace of mind. Its sleek black finish adds a modern touch to your kitchen, making it perfect for daily use. Enjoy worry-free, faster cooking with Prestige\'s highest safety standards. Ideal for preparing healthy, delicious meals for your family!', '2024-08-25 10:34:19', '2024-08-25 10:34:19', 36, 4),
(163, 'Prestige Ceraglide Ceramic Coating Non-Stick Aluminium Cookware Deep Kadai', 1675, 1340, NULL, 'The Prestige Ceraglide Deep Kadai is perfect for modern kitchens, featuring a durable ceramic coating that ensures effortless non-stick cooking. This 24 cm, 3-litre deep kadai is designed to reduce oil usage, promoting healthier meals. The PFOA and PFAS-free coating guarantees safe cooking, while the cool-touch handle ensures safety and comfort. Compatible with both gas and induction stoves, this deep kadai offers versatility and ease of use. It heats quickly and evenly, reducing cooking time. Cleanup is a breeze with its easy-to-clean surface, and the included lid keeps food warm. Elevate your cooking experience with Prestige Ceraglide!', '2024-08-25 10:41:18', '2024-08-25 10:41:18', 16, 4),
(164, 'Prestige Platina Popular Fry Pan and Kadai Set | Gas & Induction Compatible | Stainless Steel Cookware', 2770, 1900, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Platina Popular Fry Pan and Kadai Set, designed for both gas and induction cooktops. This premium kitchen set features a 24 cm Fry Pan (2.25L) and a 24 cm Kadai with Glass Lid (2.8L), perfect for versatile cooking needs. The unique impact-forged bottom ensures even heat distribution for fast, energy-efficient cooking. Crafted with heat-resistant handles and toughened glass lids, this stainless steel cookware combines durability with safety. Ideal for frying, sautéing, and simmering, the elegant design complements any kitchen. Enjoy hassle-free cooking and easy maintenance, with a 5-year warranty for long-lasting performance.\r\n\r\n', '2024-08-25 10:55:32', '2024-08-25 10:55:32', 16, 4),
(165, 'Prestige Cast Iron Scratch Resistant Dosa Tawa - Round Base, Black, Induction & Gas Compatible', 1870, 1500, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Cast Iron Dosa Tawa, designed for even heat distribution and superior durability. This scratch-resistant tawa retains heat for longer, ensuring perfectly cooked dosas every time. Ideal for both gas and induction cooking, its heavy-gauge build promises long-lasting use, making it perfect for outdoor and indoor cooking. Pre-seasoned for natural non-stick properties, this tawa is also easy to maintain. Enjoy healthy cooking with minimal oil while reliving the traditional taste of Indian cuisine. The lifetime warranty adds peace of mind, making it a reliable choice for your kitchen.', '2024-08-25 11:37:17', '2024-08-25 11:37:17', 16, 4),
(166, 'Prestige Select Plus Omni Tawa 25 cm + Fry Pan 20 cm - Non-Stick Cookware Combo', 1800, 1000, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Select Plus Omni Tawa and Fry Pan Combo. This durable, non-stick cookware set features advanced scratch and abrasion-resistant technology, ensuring residue-free cooking every time. Perfect for everyday use, it offers even heat distribution for consistent results. Its metal spoon-friendly coating and sturdy handles enhance convenience and longevity. Ideal for making dosas, rotis, stir-fries, and more, this combo set is a must-have for health-conscious cooking. Enjoy worry-free, oil-free meals with Prestige\'s trusted non-stick coating. This combo is designed for ease of use, with metal-safe, sturdy handles for added control.', '2024-08-25 11:57:50', '2024-08-25 11:57:50', 16, 4),
(167, 'Prestige Omega Select Plus Non-stick Kadai with Lid (Black) - Residue-Free Cooking', 1310, 1050, NULL, 'Crafted with excellence, the Prestige Omega Select Plus Non-stick Kadai with Lid offers superior performance for your daily cooking needs. Its 3-layer metal spoon-friendly coating ensures durability and scratch resistance, making it ideal for long-lasting use. This round base Kadai is perfect for preparing traditional Indian dishes, ensuring residue-free cooking and easy cleanup. The sturdy handles provide a secure grip, enhancing your kitchen safety. Its non-induction base makes it suitable for gas stoves. Enjoy healthy, low-oil cooking without compromising on taste. The product comes with a one-year warranty, promising quality you can trust. Ideal for modern kitchens, this black Kadai is a must-have for effortless cooking.', '2024-08-25 12:04:20', '2024-08-25 12:05:01', 16, 4),
(168, 'Prestige Omega Deluxe Granite-finish Aluminium Non-Stick Dosa Tawa (Black) – 47 cm', 1675, 1340, NULL, 'Cook up perfect dosas every time with the Prestige Omega Deluxe Granite-finish Non-Stick Dosa Tawa. Designed with a durable 5-layer German technology coating, this 47 cm tawa ensures even cooking while being metal spoon-friendly and PFOA free for healthy cooking. Its granite-finish coating not only adds style but also increases the longevity of the non-stick surface. Compatible with both gas and induction cooktops, it\'s easy to clean, dishwasher safe, and backed by a 2-year warranty. Elevate your kitchen with Prestige cookware, ideal for dosa lovers who value quality and performance.', '2024-08-25 12:21:54', '2024-08-25 12:21:54', 16, 4),
(169, 'Product Name: Prestige Omega Select Plus Paniyarakkal with Lid (Aluminium, Non-stick)', 1400, 1120, NULL, 'Discover the perfect blend of performance and convenience with the Prestige Omega Select Plus Paniyarakkal. Designed for hassle-free cooking, this non-stick pan offers even heat distribution, ensuring your dishes are cooked to perfection. Its scratch-resistant technology prolongs the pan\'s life, while the PFOA-free coating ensures safety and health. The glass lid and sturdy handle make cooking safer and easier. Ideal for cooking a variety of foods, from crispy paniyaram to sautéed vegetables, it’s metal spoon-friendly for added convenience. The unique elevated design avoids hot spots, providing consistent results. A must-have for every kitchen, this cookware is not induction compatible. Elevate your culinary experience with smart, safe, and durable cookware designed for everyday use.', '2024-08-25 12:27:52', '2024-08-25 12:27:52', 16, 4),
(170, 'Prestige Platina Popular Stainless Steel 3PCS BYK Cookware Set', 3825, 2300, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Platina Popular Stainless Steel 3PCS BYK Cookware Set. This elegant set includes a Fry Pan, Sauce Pan, and Kadai, all made from high-quality stainless steel with a toughened glass lid for enhanced durability. The unique impact forged bottom ensures faster and even cooking on both gas and induction stoves, while the soft-touch heat-resistant handles provide comfortable handling. This set is perfect for making a variety of dishes, from frying to simmering sauces. Its versatile, modern design makes it an ideal addition to any kitchen. Plus, it meets the highest safety standards, giving you peace of mind while cooking. Cook faster, more evenly, and with style using this Prestige cookware set that is built to last.', '2024-08-25 12:35:36', '2024-08-25 12:35:36', 16, 4),
(171, 'Prestige Hard Anodised Induction Base Multi-Kadai with Glass Lid', 3595, 3236, NULL, 'This multi-purpose Prestige Multi-Kadai is crafted from high-quality hard anodised aluminium, making it durable and perfect for versatile cooking needs. With a sleek black design and accessories like Dhokla and Idli plates, it\'s ideal for preparing traditional dishes like idlis, dhoklas, and patras. The round bottom enhances deep frying, while the induction-compatible base provides flexibility for various heat sources. Featuring perma-cool handles for easy handling, this kadai is perfect for modern kitchens. Its multifunctionality makes it a must-have for any cooking enthusiast looking to save space and enhance their culinary skills.', '2024-08-25 12:45:21', '2024-08-25 12:45:21', 16, 4),
(172, 'Prestige Tri Ply Splendor Stainless Steel Sauce Pan with Glass Lid - 18cm, 2 L', 2620, 1830, NULL, 'Elevate your kitchen experience with the Prestige Tri Ply Splendor Sauce Pan, designed for efficiency and durability. This 18cm saucepan is crafted from premium stainless steel with a tri-ply construction that ensures even heat distribution and excellent heat retention. Its sleek silver finish and glass lid add a touch of elegance while allowing you to monitor cooking progress. Compatible with both gas and induction stoves, this versatile saucepan features improved perma-cool handles for safe handling and a rust-proof surface for long-lasting performance. With a lifetime warranty, this saucepan combines functionality with style, making it a valuable addition to any kitchen.', '2024-08-25 12:49:18', '2024-08-25 12:49:18', 16, 4),
(173, 'Prestige Omega Select Plus Non-stick Square Tawa (Black)', 1880, 1692, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Omega Select Plus Non-stick Square Tawa, designed to deliver exceptional performance for healthy and delicious cooking. Its PFOA-free non-stick coating ensures food doesn’t stick while promoting safe, toxin-free meals. The tawa features an extreme scratch-resistant surface, making it durable for everyday use. The sturdy handles provide a comfortable grip for hassle-free cooking. Compatible with gas stoves, this tawa is perfect for preparing dosas, rotis, pancakes, and more. Easy to clean and maintain, it ensures lasting performance. A one-year warranty guarantees quality.', '2024-08-25 12:55:30', '2024-08-25 12:55:30', 16, 4),
(174, 'Prestige Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Tope Set - 6 Pcs', 10480, 9480, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Tri-Ply Stainless Steel Tope Set featuring 6 essential sizes (12 cm to 22 cm) for all your cooking needs. Made with high-quality tri-ply material, these topes ensure even heat distribution, reducing cooking time and enhancing flavor. Suitable for both gas stoves and induction cooktops, they are perfect for modern kitchens. Their durable construction promises longevity, with a sleek design that adds elegance to any cookware collection. These topes are perfect for boiling, simmering, and even serving. The easy-to-clean stainless steel material resists rust and discoloration. Enjoy peace of mind with the 5-year manufacturer warranty. Whether you\'re cooking for a family or hosting a party, this set has you covered. Invest in premium cookware with the Prestige Tri-Ply Tope Set for a superior cooking experience.', '2024-08-25 13:21:34', '2024-08-25 13:21:34', 16, 4),
(175, 'Prestige Tri Ply Splendor Stainless Steel Casserole with Glass Lid - Induction & Gas Compatible', 3350, 2350, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Tri Ply Splendor Stainless Steel Casserole. Crafted from premium stainless steel, this versatile casserole is perfect for gas and induction cooking. Its thick gauge ensures even heat distribution, minimizing hot spots for flawless dishes every time. Featuring improved Perma-Cool handles for safe and comfortable handling, this casserole is designed to last. The toughened glass lid allows you to monitor your cooking without losing moisture or flavor. Ideal for both everyday meals and special occasions, this durable cookware is built to withstand the test of time. Experience worry-free cooking with its lifetime warranty. Cook healthier meals faster, and enhance your kitchen with the Prestige Tri Ply Splendor Stainless Steel Casserole.', '2024-08-25 13:27:27', '2024-08-25 13:27:27', 16, 4),
(176, 'Prestige Tri-ply Stainless Steel Induction Base Tope with Lid, 22 cm, 3.9 L (Silver)', 3380, 2370, NULL, 'Elevate your kitchen with the Prestige Tri-ply Stainless Steel Tope, designed for modern cooking. With a 3.9-liter capacity, it provides ample space for preparing large meals. The tri-ply layer ensures even heat distribution, saving time and energy while preventing hot spots. Made from 304-grade stainless steel with an aluminum core, it\'s both gas and induction compatible. Its durable construction makes it ideal for everyday use. The tope includes a sturdy lid to retain moisture and enhance flavors. Backed by a 5-year warranty, this cookware offers reliability and convenience for all your culinary needs.', '2024-08-25 13:37:35', '2024-08-25 13:37:35', 16, 4),
(177, 'Prestige Platina Non-stick Stainless Steel Unique Impact Forged Bottom Kadai with Glass Lid, 20cm, 1.5L (Silver)', 1625, 1300, NULL, 'Experience superior cooking with the Prestige Platina Non-stick Kadai, designed for effortless, healthy meals. This 20cm Kadai features a 4-layer non-stick coating, ensuring minimal oil usage and easy cleaning. The unique impact-forged bottom ensures even heat distribution for fast and efficient cooking. Its sturdy, heat-resistant handles provide a comfortable grip, while the toughened glass lid locks in flavors and moisture. PFOA-free, this Kadai is safe for gas and induction stoves, making it versatile for modern kitchens. Built to last, it comes with a 5-year product warranty and a 1-year warranty on the non-stick coating. Enjoy cooking with Prestige’s highest safety standards and durable design. Perfect for everyday use, this Kadai is an ideal addition to any home cook’s collection.', '2024-08-25 14:05:33', '2024-08-25 14:05:33', 16, 4),
(178, 'Philips 7.3L XXL Airfryer with Smart Sensing Technology - Chef Ranveer Brar Signature Edition', 39995, 29995, NULL, 'Experience healthier cooking with the Philips 7.3L Airfryer featuring Smart Sensing Technology, which automatically adjusts cooking time and temperature for perfect results every time. Enjoy crispy, delicious meals with up to 50% less fat thanks to Rapid Air Technology. This sleek, black-and-copper design offers a spacious capacity suitable for families, easy cleaning, and dishwasher-safe parts. The airfryer includes multiple preset programs, a keep-warm feature, and no preheating is required. Elevate your kitchen with a versatile, energy-efficient appliance, backed by a 2-year global warranty, perfect for creating chef-inspired dishes with ease. Order now and enjoy exclusive offers!', '2024-08-31 09:00:33', '2024-08-31 09:25:42', 37, 5),
(179, 'Philips Airfryer HD9257/80 - 5.6L Digital Air Fryer with Rapid Air Technology & See-Through Window', 15995, 9995, NULL, 'The Philips Airfryer HD9257/80 offers a healthier way to enjoy your favorite fried foods with up to 90% less fat using Rapid Air Technology. With a 5.6-liter capacity and a digital touch screen featuring 7 preset menus, it provides versatile cooking options including frying, baking, grilling, roasting, dehydrating, and reheating. Its unique see-through cooking window lets you monitor your food without opening the fryer, ensuring optimal results every time. The airfryer is easy to clean, dishwasher safe, and comes with a 2-year warranty, plus an additional 1-year warranty when purchased online. This stylish black airfryer, with a 1700-watt power output, is designed for convenience, efficiency, and delicious, crispy results.', '2024-08-31 09:32:05', '2024-08-31 09:32:05', 37, 5),
(180, 'Philips 6.2L Extra Large Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology - NA130/00', 8995, 7095, NULL, 'The Philips 6.2L Extra Large Airfryer NA130/00 brings you a healthier way to enjoy your favorite meals with up to 90% less fat, thanks to its advanced Rapid Air Technology. Perfect for frying, baking, grilling, roasting, reheating, and more, this air fryer features a spacious 6.2-liter capacity to cater to all your family’s needs. The innovative StarPlate design ensures even cooking, resulting in crispy exteriors and tender insides with minimal or no added oil. With easy-to-use knobs for time and temperature control, you can effortlessly prepare various dishes in just a few minutes. The dishwasher-safe parts make cleanup quick and simple. Its compact design and black finish suit any kitchen decor, while the 1700-watt power ensures efficient cooking. Elevate your cooking experience with the Philips NA130/00 Airfryer, your perfect partner for tasty, guilt-free meals every day!', '2024-08-31 09:43:12', '2024-08-31 09:43:12', 37, 5),
(181, 'Philips 9L Airfryer with Dual Baskets - NA352/00', 16995, 13995, NULL, 'Philips 9L Airfryer with Dual Baskets - NA352/00: Elevate your cooking with the Philips 9L Airfryer, featuring innovative Dual Baskets for efficient full tray cooking. Equipped with Rapid Air Technology, this airfryer ensures perfectly crispy results with less oil. The large 9-liter capacity is ideal for family meals, allowing simultaneous cooking of mains and sides. With 8 preset menus, it offers versatility for frying, baking, grilling, and more. Enjoy synchronized cooking with auto-sync timers, ensuring all dishes are ready together. The digital interface and rapid heat distribution make it user-friendly and efficient. Save on your purchase with exclusive discounts and extended warranty options. Perfect for healthier, faster cooking without compromising on taste.', '2024-08-31 09:58:12', '2024-08-31 09:58:12', 37, 5),
(182, 'Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology and Cooking Window - NA231/00:', 9999, 11999, NULL, 'Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology and Cooking Window - NA231/00: Experience healthier cooking with the Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer, designed to deliver crispy results with minimal oil. Featuring Rapid Air Technology and a unique cooking window, this airfryer ensures evenly cooked meals that are crispy outside and tender inside. With its versatile functions, including frying, baking, grilling, and roasting, it\'s perfect for all your cooking needs. The large 6.2-liter capacity is ideal for family-sized portions. Enjoy additional savings with our exclusive offers and extended warranty options. This airfryer is user-friendly, with easy temperature control and a quick-clean design. Enhance your kitchen with Philips\' innovative airfrying technology for delicious, guilt-free meals.', '2024-08-31 10:16:23', '2024-08-31 10:16:23', 37, 5),
(183, 'Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology and Cooking Window - NA231/00:', 9999, 11999, NULL, 'Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer with Rapid Air Technology and Cooking Window - NA231/00: Experience healthier cooking with the Philips 6.2 Liter Airfryer, designed to deliver crispy results with minimal oil. Featuring Rapid Air Technology and a unique cooking window, this airfryer ensures evenly cooked meals that are crispy outside and tender inside. With its versatile functions, including frying, baking, grilling, and roasting, it\'s perfect for all your cooking needs. The large 6.2-liter capacity is ideal for family-sized portions. Enjoy additional savings with our exclusive offers and extended warranty options. This airfryer is user-friendly, with easy temperature control and a quick-clean design. Enhance your kitchen with Philips\' innovative airfrying technology for delicious, guilt-free meals.', '2024-08-31 10:16:24', '2024-08-31 10:16:24', 37, 5),
(184, 'Prestige Royale 4-Burner Glass Top Gas Stove - Schott Glass, Elegant Design, Durable Cooking Appliance', 14295, 10720, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Royale Duplex Schott Glass Top Gas Stove (4 Burners) - DGT 04. This elegant gas stove features a toughened glass top from Schott, Germany, ensuring durability and style. Equipped with SABAF valves from Italy, ergonomic knob design, and tri-pin burners for even heat distribution, this stove guarantees efficient and safe cooking. With a 2-year product warranty and a lifetime warranty on the Schott glass, it combines functionality and reliability. Enjoy effortless cleaning and a sleek design that enhances your kitchen aesthetics. Choose Prestige for the highest safety standards and quality craftsmanship.', '2024-08-31 12:30:53', '2024-08-31 13:28:15', 38, 4),
(185, 'Prestige Kitchen Family Pack – 2-Burner Gas Stove, Mixer Grinder, Electric Kettle, Pressure Cooker, and Kitchen Essentials', 14870, 9999, NULL, 'The Prestige Kitchen Family Pack is an all-in-one kitchen solution designed to simplify your cooking experience. This pack includes a 2-burner gas stove with a spill-proof, toughened glass top, a powerful Diva Mixer Grinder, an electric kettle with cool-touch handles, and a durable pressure cooker made from virgin aluminum. Additionally, the set features a high-quality veggie cutter and a non-stick festival cookware pack. Perfect for every modern kitchen, this family pack is built with superior materials, offering ergonomic design, durability, and ease of use. Upgrade your kitchen with Prestige for efficient and safe cooking today!', '2024-08-31 12:47:40', '2024-08-31 13:28:34', 38, 4),
(186, 'Prestige Royale Plus GT03L 3-Burner Manual Gas Stove with Toughened Glass Top', 12395, 7590, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige Royale Plus GT03L, a 3-burner gas stove with a sleek, toughened glass top and an elegant design that enhances your kitchen\'s style. This durable gas stove offers superior safety, with ergonomic knobs and individual pan support, ensuring a worry-free cooking experience. With a lifetime warranty on SCHOTT glass, it’s built to withstand high thermal shocks and mechanical impacts. Enjoy easy maintenance and effortless cleaning, thanks to its robust, powder-coated body. Perfect for modern kitchens, this gas stove combines functionality with aesthetics, providing efficient cooking every day.', '2024-08-31 14:10:56', '2024-08-31 14:10:56', 38, 4),
(187, 'Prestige Magic Powder Coated Glass Top Gas Stove (4 Burners) - GTMC 04 Square', 9595, 5195, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the stylish and durable Prestige Magic Powder Coated Glass Top Gas Stove. Featuring four efficient tri-pin burners, a toughened black glass top, and an ergonomic knob design, this gas stove offers a superior cooking experience. Its spill-proof design ensures hassle-free cooking, while the 2-year warranty guarantees peace of mind. Perfect for modern kitchens, this stove combines elegance with performance, making it an ideal choice for families looking for a reliable and attractive cooking solution. Enjoy fast, secure checkout and free shipping for orders over Rs 750!', '2024-08-31 15:14:02', '2024-08-31 15:14:02', 38, 4),
(188, 'Prestige POTG 36RC Oven Toaster Griller with Convection and Air Fryer', 12395, 8680, NULL, 'Discover the versatile Prestige POTG 36RC Oven Toaster Griller, designed to elevate your cooking experience. This 36-liter capacity oven toaster griller features high-efficiency stainless steel heaters, ensuring even cooking for all your culinary creations. With convection functionality, it offers perfect browning and crispiness, ideal for pizzas, cakes, and roasted meats. The full-size glass door provides a clear view of your dishes, while the robust stay-cool handle ensures safe handling.\r\n\r\nConvenience is key with the included crumb tray for easy cleaning, enamelled baking tray, and steel wire rack. Whether you\'re baking, toasting, or grilling, this appliance delivers exceptional performance. Enjoy the added benefit of air fryer functionality for healthier cooking with less oil. Perfect for any modern kitchen, the Prestige POTG 36RC is both stylish and practical.', '2024-08-31 17:02:29', '2024-08-31 17:02:29', 17, 4),
(189, 'Prestige POTG 9 PC Oven Toaster Griller 9 L with High-Efficiency Quartz Heaters - Compact and Versatile Kitchen Appliance', 4545, 3180, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige POTG 9 PC Oven Toaster Griller, a compact and efficient kitchen appliance perfect for baking, grilling, and toasting. With a 9-liter capacity, two high-efficiency quartz heaters, and a timer control, it ensures precise cooking. The extra deep body, full-size glass door, and stay-cool handles add convenience and safety. The powder-coated body and crumb tray make it durable and easy to clean. Ideal for preparing a wide range of delicious dishes, from pizzas to kebabs. Enhance your cooking experience with the Prestige POTG 9 PC OTG - versatile, reliable, and built to last.', '2024-08-31 17:08:04', '2024-08-31 17:08:04', 17, 4),
(190, 'Prestige POTG 26 SS RC Oven Toaster Griller with Convection and Air Fryer Function', 9995, 7000, NULL, 'Experience versatile cooking with the Prestige POTG 26 SS RC, a premium oven toaster griller featuring convection, rotisserie, and air fryer functions for healthier meals. Its stainless steel body, high-efficiency heaters, and temperature control ensure perfect results every time, from baking to grilling. With easy-to-clean accessories and thoughtful design, this 26-liter OTG is ideal for any kitchen. Enjoy free shipping, secured payments, and unmatched quality from Prestige, a trusted brand for home appliances in India. Transform your cooking experience with this all-in-one solution today!', '2024-08-31 17:12:56', '2024-08-31 17:12:56', 17, 4),
(191, 'Prestige POTG 16 SS R Oven Toaster Griller with Rotisserie Function', 6495, 4550, NULL, 'Experience the ultimate cooking versatility with the Prestige POTG 16 SS R Oven Toaster Griller. Perfect for baking, grilling, toasting, and rotisserie, this compact kitchen appliance features high-efficiency stainless steel heaters for even cooking. The durable stainless steel body, adjustable temperature control, and convenient crumb tray ensure easy cleaning and a long-lasting performance. Ideal for preparing pizzas, kebabs, cakes, and oil-free rotis, it adds convenience to every meal. Elevate your cooking game with Prestige\'s top-quality oven toaster griller, designed for delicious results every time!', '2024-08-31 17:19:38', '2024-08-31 17:19:38', 17, 4),
(192, 'Kenstar 25 Litres 1950W Convection Microwave Oven with Auto-Cook Menus', 16990, 11685, NULL, 'Upgrade your cooking experience with the Kenstar 25 Litres 1950W Convection Microwave Oven. Designed with a versatile combi function, this microwave offers 250 auto-cook menus to simplify meal preparation. Prioritize safety with the built-in child safety lock, and enjoy enhanced control with 10 power levels and an auto-defrost feature. The stylish design, featuring a chrome knob, mirror finish door, and stainless steel cavity, adds a modern touch to any kitchen. With a powerful 1950W convection capability, this microwave ensures perfect cooking results every time. Backed by a 1-year product warranty and a 3-year magnetron warranty for peace of mind.', '2024-08-31 17:26:10', '2024-08-31 17:26:50', 18, 18),
(193, ' Kenstar 20 Litres 900W Grill Microwave Oven with 30-Minute Timer', 8990, 7999, NULL, 'Experience versatile cooking with the Kenstar 20 Litres 900W Grill Microwave Oven. Ideal for small kitchens, this compact microwave offers powerful grilling with 900W grill wattage and a convenient 30-minute timer for easy meal preparation. The electro-mechanical dual knobs allow precise control, while the durable powder-coated cavity ensures long-lasting use. Tailor your cooking with 5 adjustable power levels and the added convenience of the auto-defrost function. Backed by a 1-year warranty on the product and a 3-year warranty on the magnetron, this microwave guarantees reliability and satisfaction for all your grilling needs.', '2024-08-31 17:43:54', '2024-08-31 17:43:54', 18, 18),
(194, 'Prestige Delight 1.2L Electric Rice Cooker - Compact, Efficient, and Versatile', 3495, 2620, NULL, 'The Prestige Delight 1.2L Electric Rice Cooker is your perfect kitchen companion for hassle-free cooking. With a capacity of 1.2 liters, this compact rice cooker is ideal for small families and offers multi-purpose functionality to cook rice, porridge, soups, and more. Its convenient handle, detachable power cord, and additional steamer basket make it user-friendly. Built with a durable ABS plastic body, it operates on 500W power for efficient cooking. Designed with advanced features like a steam vent and condensation cup, it guarantees safety and ease. Backed by a 1-year warranty, this electric rice cooker is an indispensable addition to your kitchen.', '2024-09-02 11:47:51', '2024-09-02 11:47:51', 36, 4),
(195, 'Prestige 1L PMC 1.0 Plus Multi Cooker with Temperature Control and Glass Lid', 1995, 1500, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige 1L PMC 1.0 Plus Multi Cooker, a versatile kitchen appliance perfect for cooking, boiling, brewing, steaming, and more. Featuring a sleek stainless steel body, an elegant glass lid, ergonomic cool-touch handles, and a temperature control function, this multi-purpose cooker is designed for convenience and style. With a 600W power capacity and safety features like an automatic cut-off and power indicator, it ensures worry-free cooking every time. Ideal for modern kitchens, this compact cooker makes meal preparation easy and efficient, offering unmatched utility and style.', '2024-09-02 12:15:33', '2024-09-02 12:15:33', 36, 4),
(196, ' Prestige Delight Electric Rice Cooker PROK 1.8 SS – Silky Red, 1.8L with Stainless Steel Cooking Pan', 3695, 2995, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige Delight Electric Rice Cooker PROK 1.8 SS in a stunning Silky Red finish, designed to make your cooking effortless and quick. With its 700W power, double-wall strong body, and cool touch handles, this rice cooker is perfect for daily use. It features a detachable power cord, an additional cooking pan, and a stainless steel lid for versatile cooking options. Enjoy perfectly cooked rice, porridge, soup, and more with ease. Ideal for busy kitchens, its compact design saves space while offering maximum utility. Shop now to elevate your cooking experience with Prestige’s innovative rice cooker.', '2024-09-02 12:26:24', '2024-09-02 12:26:24', 36, 4),
(197, 'Prestige Delight Smart 1.8-2 Rice Cooker | 1.8L Capacity | Internet-Enabled | Blue', 4995, 3250, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Delight Smart 1.8-2 Rice Cooker, featuring a generous 1.8L capacity perfect for family meals. This internet-enabled rice cooker offers smart cooking convenience by allowing you to control and monitor cooking remotely. Enjoy safe handling with cool-touch handles and seamless cooking with two aluminum cooking pans. The close-fit lid retains heat and moisture, ensuring delicious, perfectly cooked rice every time. Designed with user convenience in mind, this rice cooker also includes a detachable power cord and comes with a 1-year warranty for peace of mind. Experience modern cooking with Prestige\'s innovative rice cooker today.', '2024-09-02 13:00:38', '2024-09-02 13:00:38', 36, 4),
(198, 'Prestige Induction Cook-Top Pic 20 WIZ', 3695, 2245, NULL, 'Experience efficient and effortless cooking with the Prestige Induction Cook-Top Pic 20 WIZ. Featuring a sleek, intelligent design with an automatic whistle counter, user pre-set timer, and 1600 watts of power, this induction cooktop is perfect for all your culinary needs. Enjoy Indian menu options, an anti-magnetic wall for safety, and a voltage regulator that ensures durability. The Prestige Induction Cook-Top Pic 20 WIZ offers fast cooking with minimal energy consumption, making it a must-have for every modern kitchen. Elevate your cooking game with this powerful, affordable, and innovative appliance today!', '2024-09-02 13:19:50', '2024-09-02 13:19:50', 40, 4),
(199, 'Prestige PIC 1.0 V2 1900 Watts Induction Cooktop with Indian Menu Options', 5045, 3530, NULL, 'Discover quick and efficient cooking with the Prestige PIC 1.0 V2 Induction Cooktop, featuring a powerful 1900-watt performance and smart Indian menu options. Designed for modern kitchens, this induction cooktop offers energy-saving technology, dual heat sensors, and easy-to-clean surfaces. With an anti-magnetic wall and user-friendly touch controls, it ensures safety and convenience. Perfect for preparing your favorite dishes with precision and speed, the Prestige PIC 1.0 V2 combines style, functionality, and eco-friendliness for an exceptional cooking experience. Shop now for the best price and enjoy free shipping on orders above Rs. 750!', '2024-09-02 13:26:57', '2024-09-02 13:26:57', 40, 4),
(200, 'Prestige Induction Cooktop IRIS 2 - High-Performance Cooking Solution', 4495, 3150, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Induction Cooktop IRIS 2, designed for fast, efficient cooking. With a powerful 2000W heating capacity, Indian menu options, and feather-touch controls, this cooktop offers precision and convenience. It features a sleek anti-magnetic wall, automatic voltage regulator, and power saver technology to ensure safety and energy efficiency. Enjoy the benefits of hassle-free, quick, and delicious cooking with the Prestige IRIS 2 induction cooktop, backed by a 1-year warranty. Free shipping available for orders above ₹750. Experience the perfect blend of style and performance today!', '2024-09-02 13:46:10', '2024-09-02 13:46:10', 40, 4),
(201, 'Prestige Swish Induction Cook-Top V4', 6120, 4280, NULL, 'Experience fast, efficient, and safe cooking with the Prestige Swish Induction Cook-Top V4. Designed with a compact and elegant build, this cook-top features smart Indian menu options, automatic whistle counter, dual heat sensors, and an anti-magnetic wall for maximum safety. Its touch button control, toughened glass surface, and automatic voltage regulator ensure durability and user convenience. With a powerful 2000W output and easy-to-clean design, this induction cook-top is the perfect addition to your modern kitchen. Enjoy free shipping on orders above Rs 750 and a one-year warranty for peace of mind.', '2024-09-02 13:53:15', '2024-09-02 13:53:15', 40, 4),
(202, 'Prestige Infrared Cooktop PIRC 1.0 - 2200W, Stainless Steel & Ceramic, Adjustable Temperature Control, Cool Touch Handle, 1-Year Warranty, Black', 4275, 2990, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige Infrared Cooktop PIRC 1.0, your ultimate solution for efficient and versatile cooking. With a powerful 2200W heating element, adjustable temperature control, and cool touch handle, this stainless steel and ceramic cooktop offers a seamless cooking experience. Compatible with all flat-base cookware, it features pre-set cooking modes and a sleek design for easy maintenance. Perfect for every modern kitchen, this cooktop combines advanced technology with safety for perfect meals every time. Elevate your cooking with the Prestige Infrared Cooktop PIRC 1.0, made in India and backed by a 1-year warranty.', '2024-09-02 14:01:13', '2024-09-02 14:01:13', 40, 4),
(203, 'Buy Prestige Double Induction Cooktop PDIC 3.0 Online – Best Price & Features | TTK Prestige.', 11665, 8170, NULL, 'Discover the Prestige Double Induction Cooktop (PDIC 3.0), a smart kitchen appliance designed for modern homes. With dual cooking stations, power saver technology, and an automatic voltage regulator, it ensures efficient and safe cooking every time. The cooktop features Indian menu options for authentic recipes, is easy to clean, and comes with a 1-year warranty. With 2000W and 1200W power settings, this induction cooktop is perfect for all your culinary needs. Experience worry-free cooking with Prestige\'s renowned safety standards and enjoy free shipping on orders above Rs 750.', '2024-09-02 14:09:46', '2024-09-02 14:09:46', 40, 4),
(204, 'Prestige Glass Top Marvel GTM 04 SS Gas Stove – High Efficiency & Stylish Design | TTK Prestige', 104545, 8436, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Glass Top Marvel GTM 04 SS gas stove, designed for both style and functionality. Featuring an elegant black toughened glass top, this gas stove is not only stylish but also easy to clean. Equipped with high-efficiency brass burners and individual pan supports, it ensures stable and quick cooking. The spill-proof design prevents messes, while the four tri-pin brass burners offer versatile cooking options. With its durable stainless steel body and automatic ignition, this gas stove combines performance with convenience. Enjoy efficient cooking and free shipping on orders above Rs 750 with Prestige.', '2024-09-02 14:23:01', '2024-09-02 14:23:01', 38, 4),
(205, 'Prestige Svachh Neo Toughened Glass Top Gas Stove - Black (Model GTSN 03)', 11295, 8470, NULL, 'Elevate your cooking experience with the Prestige Svachh Neo Toughened Glass Top Gas Stove. Designed for both style and functionality, this premium gas stove features a modern black toughened glass top that adds elegance to any kitchen. With three liftable brass burners, it offers efficient cooking and easy maintenance. The sturdy pan support ensures stability while cooking, while the superior toughened glass top provides durability and easy cleaning. The stove comes with a 2-year warranty for added peace of mind. Enjoy effortless cooking with the ergonomic push-button ignition and highest safety standards. Perfect for any modern kitchen, the Prestige Svachh Neo combines aesthetics with practicality.', '2024-09-02 14:28:53', '2024-09-02 14:28:53', 38, 4),
(206, 'Prestige Marvel Plus Toughened Glass Top Gas Stove (1 Burner) - GTM 01', 4095, 3070, NULL, 'Enhance your kitchen with the Prestige Marvel Plus Gas Stove, featuring a sleek toughened glass top that offers both durability and style. The GTM 01 model is designed with a high-speed jumbo burner for rapid cooking and a spill-proof design that keeps your kitchen clean. Its superior tri-pin burner ensures even heat distribution, making cooking efficient and hassle-free. Enjoy ergonomic knob design for easy control and a modern touch in your culinary space. With a 2-year warranty, this gas stove promises reliability and long-term performance. Ideal for small spaces or single-cooking needs, the Prestige Marvel Plus is a practical and elegant addition to any kitchen. Elevate your cooking experience today with this top-notch gas stove.', '2024-09-02 14:45:13', '2024-09-02 14:52:19', 38, 4),
(207, 'Prestige Royale Stainless Steel Gas Stove - DGS', 9695, 7270, NULL, 'Discover unparalleled cooking convenience with the Prestige Royale Stainless Steel Gas Stove. Designed for efficiency, this premium gas stove features a robust stainless steel body with high-efficiency brass burners and a sleek, spill-proof design. With its two-step design accommodating multiple vessels and individual pan support, it\'s perfect for any kitchen setup. Enjoy precise cooking with the tri-pin burners and ergonomic knob design. Backed by a 2-year warranty, this gas stove combines durability with style, offering a royal cooking experience. Upgrade your kitchen with this essential appliance and enjoy effortless, worry-free cooking.', '2024-09-02 14:48:11', '2024-09-02 14:52:03', 38, 4),
(208, 'Prestige Shakti Stainless Steel Gas Stove (2 Burners)', 4545, 3410, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Prestige Shakti Stainless Steel Gas Stove. This high-quality gas stove features two efficient tri-pin brass burners, ensuring optimal heat distribution for faster cooking. With a sleek stainless steel body, it adds a modern touch to any kitchen while being easy to clean and maintain. The stove is designed with taller legs and folded edges for enhanced safety and durability. Its press-fit knobs provide a comfortable grip and precise flame control. ISI certified, it meets the highest safety standards. Ideal for everyday cooking, the Prestige Shakti gas stove is a reliable choice for any home.', '2024-09-02 14:54:55', '2024-09-02 14:54:55', 38, 4),
(209, 'Philips 2100 Watts Induction Cooktop with Auto-Off Function - HD4929/01', 4995, 3495, NULL, 'Experience efficient and healthy cooking with the Philips 2100 Watts Induction Cooktop - HD4929/01. This advanced induction cooktop is designed to make meal preparation quicker and more convenient. With its high power output of 2100 watts, you can enjoy faster cooking times and precise temperature control. The cooktop features a cool-to-touch ceramic surface, ensuring safe and comfortable use. Its auto-off function provides an added layer of safety by turning off the cooktop when not in use. Equipped with customized programs for Indian dishes, it makes cooking traditional meals a breeze. Easy to clean and maintain, this induction cooktop is perfect for modern kitchens.', '2024-09-02 16:33:04', '2024-09-02 16:33:04', 40, 5);
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `name`, `original_price`, `offer_price`, `discount`, `description`, `created`, `modified`, `category_id`, `company_id`) VALUES
(210, 'Philips 1300W Induction Cooktop with Triple MOV for 4kW Surge Protection and Soft Touch Control - HD4934/00', 3995, 1945, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen with the Philips 1300W Induction Cooktop - HD4934/00, designed for efficient and safe cooking. This induction cooktop features advanced electromagnetic induction technology that heats up quickly, ensuring faster cooking while sealing in the nutrients and vitamins. With Triple MOV for 4kW surge protection, it offers enhanced safety against voltage spikes. The soft touch controls provide a seamless and user-friendly experience, while the micro-crystal plate design adds a sleek, modern look to your kitchen. Enjoy hassle-free maintenance with its easy-to-clean surface, and cook with confidence using its precision heating capabilities. Perfect for contemporary kitchens, this induction cooktop is a must-have for those who value both style and functionality.', '2024-09-02 16:38:55', '2024-09-02 16:38:55', 40, 5),
(211, 'Philips 2100W Induction Cooktop with Triple MOV for 4kW Surge Protection and Feather Touch Control - HD4995/00', 6295, 3595, NULL, 'Experience a smarter, safer, and faster way to cook with the Philips 2100W Induction Cooktop - HD4995/00. This induction cooktop features electromagnetic induction technology that ensures high heating efficiency, allowing you to cook meals faster than traditional gas stoves. With Triple MOV technology, it offers 4kW surge protection, safeguarding your appliance from voltage fluctuations. The feather touch controls provide easy operation and precision, while the cool-to-touch micro crystal plate adds elegance and safety. Perfect for modern kitchens, it supports a variety of cooking styles with multiple power levels. Lightweight, compact, and designed for easy cleaning, this induction cooktop is an ideal choice for healthy and effortless cooking.', '2024-09-02 16:44:44', '2024-09-02 16:44:44', 40, 5),
(212, 'Philips 600 Watts 2-Slice Toaster with Integrated Bun Rack Black - HD2583/90', 3095, 2595, NULL, 'Upgrade your breakfast routine with the Philips 2-Slice Toaster - HD2583/90. This compact toaster offers 8 browning settings to customize your toast, ensuring perfectly browned slices every time. With two large variable slots, it accommodates different bread sizes, from thin slices to thicker sandwich loaves. The integrated bun rack allows you to warm buns, pastries, and rolls effortlessly. Featuring a defrost and reheat function, this toaster is versatile for any morning need. The cancel button ensures you can stop toasting at any time for precise control. Designed with a cool wall exterior for safety and automatic shut-off for added peace of mind. Enjoy efficient toasting with this durable and stylish kitchen appliance from Philips.', '2024-09-02 16:51:16', '2024-09-02 16:51:16', 29, 5),
(213, 'Philips Two Slice Pop Up Toaster with Bun Warmer - HD2582/00', 2795, 2195, NULL, 'Start your day with perfectly toasted bread using the Philips HD2582/00 Two Slice Pop Up Toaster. This versatile toaster features 8 browning settings for customizable toasting, ensuring you achieve your desired level of crispness every time. It comes with 2 large variable slots to accommodate different bread sizes, from regular slices to thicker sandwich loaves. The integrated bun rack makes it easy to warm buns, pastries, and rolls. With a high lift function, you can safely retrieve smaller pieces of bread without burning your fingers. The toaster also includes a cancel button to stop toasting anytime, along with a defrost function for frozen bread. The cool wall exterior and automatic shut-off feature ensure safe operation. Designed for convenience, this compact toaster is perfect for any kitchen.', '2024-09-02 16:57:27', '2024-09-02 16:57:27', 29, 5),
(214, 'Philips Sandwich Maker XL Sized HD2288/00', 3795, 3295, NULL, 'Enjoy delicious, evenly toasted sandwiches at home with the Philips HD2288/00 XL Sandwich Maker. This sandwich maker features XL-sized non-stick plates that ensure easy cleaning and allow for bigger, crispier sandwiches. The secure push-down lock mechanism provides safe operation while the ergonomically designed cool-touch handle with a handle lock offers convenience. Equipped with a light indicator, the red light shows when the unit is on, and the green light signals when it\'s preheated and ready for use. With Insta heating technology, the maker heats up quickly, letting you prepare tasty sandwiches in no time. It also includes cord storage for a tidy kitchen setup. Designed for everyday use, this compact sandwich maker is a perfect addition to your kitchen appliances.', '2024-09-02 17:02:04', '2024-09-02 17:02:04', 28, 5),
(215, 'Philips Panini Sandwich Maker XL Sized HD2289/00', 3795, 3195, NULL, 'Make deliciously grilled sandwiches and wraps at home with the Philips Panini Sandwich Maker HD2289/00. Featuring XL-sized non-stick plates, this sandwich maker ensures easy cleaning and makes large, crispy sandwiches effortlessly. With a secure push-down locking mechanism and an ergonomically designed cool-touch handle, it provides safe and comfortable handling. The light indicator shows when the appliance is ready for use, and the insta-heating feature quickly preheats the plates, saving you time. Perfect for everyday use, this panini maker is compact, easy to store, and adds convenience to your kitchen.', '2024-09-02 17:07:24', '2024-09-02 17:07:24', 28, 5),
(216, 'Philips 1.2 L Kettle with 25% Thicker Body for Longer Life - HD9363/02', 1995, 1895, NULL, 'Enjoy quick and safe boiling with the Philips 1.2 L Electric Kettle HD9363/02. Made with food-grade stainless steel, this kettle features a 25% thicker body for enhanced durability and a rust-proof SS 304 grade steel interior. With a powerful 1500W heating element, it boils water efficiently, making it perfect for tea, coffee, and more. The kettle\'s sleek grey finish adds a modern touch to your kitchen. Compact and easy to handle, it\'s designed for convenience and longevity.', '2024-09-02 17:09:52', '2024-09-02 17:09:52', 32, 5),
(217, 'Philips 1.5 L Double-Walled Electric Kettle with Keep Warm Function - HD9378/80', 2795, 2195, NULL, 'Enhance your kitchen with the Philips Double-Walled Electric Kettle HD9378/80, offering both style and functionality. This kettle features a 1.5-liter capacity and is perfect for small households or offices. The double-walled construction keeps the exterior cool while maintaining hot water for longer. With its Keep Warm function, your water stays at the perfect temperature until you\'re ready to pour. The auto shut-off feature ensures safety by automatically turning off the kettle when the water reaches a boil or if it runs dry.', '2024-09-02 17:15:38', '2024-09-02 17:15:38', 32, 5),
(218, 'Philips Mixer Grinder 3 Jar 750W Turbo Motor - HL7756/01', 4795, 3695, NULL, 'Upgrade your kitchen experience with the Philips Mixer Grinder HL7756/01 featuring a powerful 750W Turbo Motor that ensures efficient grinding, even for tough ingredients like black gram (dal). With a compact, triangular design for easy cleaning, this mixer grinder is equipped with three stainless steel jars, advanced air ventilation for faster cooling, and leak-proof lids. The durable coupler ensures a firm engagement between the jars and the body, allowing continuous, hassle-free grinding.', '2024-09-02 17:21:35', '2024-09-02 17:21:35', 22, 5),
(219, 'Philips Viva Collection 750W Mixer Grinder for Tough Grinding - HL7699/00', 5895, 4995, NULL, 'The Philips Viva Collection 750W Mixer Grinder (HL7699/00) is your perfect kitchen companion, designed to handle the toughest grinding with ease. Featuring a powerful 750-watt motor, leak-proof stainless steel jars, and an ABS body for durability, this mixer grinder ensures efficient performance for daily use. Its auto cut-off protection enhances motor life, while the sleek design makes it easy to clean and maintain. With multiple speed settings and overload protection, it’s built for convenience and safety. Ideal for blending, grinding, and mixing, this mixer grinder makes food preparation effortless. Enjoy the best of Philips technology for a hassle-free cooking experience.', '2024-09-02 17:27:27', '2024-09-02 17:27:27', 22, 5),
(220, 'Philips Mixer Grinder with Food Processor Jar 750W White - HL7763/00', 8995, 5495, NULL, 'The Philips Mixer Grinder with Food Processor Jar 750W White (HL7763/00) is designed to make your kitchen tasks effortless. With a powerful 750W turbo motor and gear drive technology, it handles even tough grinding, chopping, kneading, and juicing with ease. Featuring 4 jars, including a food processor jar, this versatile mixer grinder offers multiple speed settings, Power Chop technology for superior chopping, and dishwasher-safe components for easy cleaning. Its leak-proof design ensures mess-free operation, while the overload protection enhances safety. Perfect for preparing delicious meals quickly, this mixer grinder is your all-in-one solution for a hassle-free cooking experience.', '2024-09-02 17:31:19', '2024-09-02 17:31:19', 22, 5),
(221, 'Philips 1000W Mixer Grinder HL7703/00 - Powerful, Durable, and Efficient Kitchen Appliance', 8595, 6499, NULL, 'Discover the Philips 1000 Watt Mixer Grinder (HL7703/00) that delivers powerful performance with a robust 1000W motor for fast and efficient grinding, blending, and mixing. Its leak-proof jars and advanced blades handle even the toughest ingredients with ease, ensuring no lumps or spills. Ideal for making smooth batters, fine spice powders, and fresh juices with its unique fruit filter. With three sturdy jars, a durable ABS body, and suction feet for stability, this mixer grinder offers superior quality and reliability. Perfect for Indian kitchens, it provides noiseless operation, easy cleaning, and a stylish design that complements any kitchen decor.', '2024-09-02 17:34:43', '2024-09-02 17:34:43', 22, 5),
(222, 'Philips 500W 2 Jar Mixer Grinder HL7506/00 - Compact and Powerful Kitchen Appliance', 3595, 2995, NULL, 'Introducing the Philips 500 Watt 2 Jar Mixer Grinder (HL7506/00), a compact and efficient kitchen appliance designed to handle everyday cooking needs. Equipped with a powerful 500W motor, this mixer grinder effortlessly grinds and blends tough ingredients like spices, chutneys, and purees. Its two stainless steel jars ensure durability and easy maintenance, while the large, easy-to-use switch knobs provide control over multiple speeds. The non-slip feet offer stability during operation, and its ergonomic design makes storage simple. Perfect for small to medium-sized kitchens, this mixer grinder is your reliable companion for hassle-free meal preparation.', '2024-09-02 17:38:23', '2024-09-02 17:38:23', 22, 5),
(223, 'Philips 500W Mixer Grinder with 3 Jars HL7505/00 – Powerful, Efficient, and User-Friendly Kitchen Appliance', 4095, 2995, NULL, 'The Philips 500W Powerful and Efficient Mixer Grinder with 3 Jars (HL7505/00) is the perfect kitchen companion for all your grinding and blending needs. Featuring a robust 500-watt motor, it effortlessly grinds tough ingredients like spices, chutneys, and purees with ease. The short-armed mixer blades ensure precise mixing, while the leak-proof jars provide mess-free operations. Designed with large switch knobs for easy speed control, this mixer grinder offers stability even when grinding the toughest ingredients. Compact and easy to store, it\'s ideal for any kitchen space. Enjoy a 2-year warranty, sustainable packaging, and a user-friendly design for everyday use.', '2024-09-02 17:42:01', '2024-09-02 17:42:01', 22, 5),
(224, 'LG 21 L Convection Microwave Oven (MC2146BV, Black, With Heathplus menu & Quartz Heater)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'This 21-litre microwave oven is ideal for small families, couples, or singles, providing versatile functionality for baking, grilling, reheating, defrosting, and cooking at maximum temperature. It features multiple programs including Microwave, Grill, Convection, and Combination modes, along with specialized Indian cuisine settings like Tandoor, Tea/Dairy Delight, Low Calorie, Kids Delight, and Steam Cook. The appliance is also equipped with convenient functions such as Stop/Clear and Start. \r\n\r\nThe oven consumes 1150 W for grilling, 1860 W for convection, and offers five microwave power levels with an 800 W power output. It includes 151 auto-cook menus under the Healthplus menu, offering healthy recipes for breakfast, lunch, snacks, and dinner. For example, you can prepare Wheat Rava Idli, Chana Dal Pancake, and Moong Dal Chilla for breakfast, and dishes like Methi Missi Roti and Grilled Veggies for lunch.\r\n\r\nSpecial features include a quartz heater for concealed and safer cooking, a stainless steel cavity for enhanced hygiene and durability, a completion beeper, child lock, keep warm function, and a membrane control panel that is sensitive to touch and easy to clean. Additional features such as Timed Cook, Defrost, Programmable Timer, Energy Saving Mode, and Dehumidification help keep foods like biscuits and chips crisp and fresh.\r\n\r\nThe microwave’s dimensions are 47.5 cm x 28.5 cm x 46 cm (W x H x D), with an inner stainless steel cavity and a turntable diameter of 9.64 inches. Included in the box are a glass tray, a rotating ring, and a user manual. This product comes with a 1-year manufacturer warranty from the date of purchase. Please note that the brand does not provide a starter kit with this product.', '2024-09-03 10:55:38', '2024-09-03 10:55:38', 18, 14),
(225, 'LG 28 L Charcoal Convection Microwave Oven (MJ2887BFUM, Black, with 360° Motorised Rotisserie & Charcoal Lighting Heater with 10 years warranty)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'This 28-litre charcoal convection microwave oven is designed for families of 4-6 members, offering diverse cooking options such as baking, grilling, reheating, defrosting, and more at maximum temperature. The oven features multiple cooking modes, including Micro, Grill, Combination, and Convection, with specialized programs like Healthy Heart, Charcoal/Indian Cuisine, Roti Basket, Ghee, Diet Fry, Low Calorie, Pasteurized Milk, Kid\'s Delight, Tea/Dairy Delight, Cooking Aid, and Steam Clean. The intuitive control panel includes Start, Stop, and Clear buttons for easy operation.\r\n\r\nWith a convection power consumption of 1950 W, grill power consumption of 1200 W, and five microwave power levels, the oven is efficient and versatile. It comes with 301 auto-cook menus featuring delicious and healthy recipes, including Wheat Rava Idli, Spinach and Tofu Toast, Healthy Ragi Pizza, Murg Tandoori, Fish Tandoori, Kadhai Chicken, Baigan Ka Barta, Suji Halwa, and many more.\r\n\r\nSpecial features of the microwave include a Charcoal Lighting Heater that enhances natural flavors, making dishes crispy on the outside and juicy inside. It offers 30 heart-friendly recipes, a 360° motorized rotisserie for barbecuing at home, and a Diet Fry function that enables cooking with minimal oil. The stainless steel cavity is more hygienic and durable, and the pasteurized milk feature retains nutrition while removing bacteria.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include defrost, programmable cooking, child lock for safety, an interior light, a side swing door, a completion beeper, and timed cook options. The control type is a tactile dial for precise settings. The oven\'s dimensions are 51 cm x 31 cm x 52 cm (W x H x D), with a stainless steel inner cavity and a turntable diameter of 12.59 inches.\r\n\r\nIncluded in the box are a glass tray, rotating ring, MC tawa, high rack, low rack, rotisserie bar and handle, and a pasteurized milk kit. The product comes with a 1-year warranty on the microwave oven and a 10-year warranty on the charcoal heater parts (terms and conditions apply). Note that a starter kit is not provided with this product.', '2024-09-03 11:13:25', '2024-09-03 11:13:25', 18, 14),
(226, 'LG 28 L Convection Microwave Oven (MC2846BV, Black, Quartz Heater)', NULL, 0, NULL, 'This convection microwave oven is designed for versatile cooking needs, including baking, grilling, reheating, defrosting, and cooking at a maximum temperature. With a capacity of 28 liters, it is suitable for households with 4-6 members. Please note that the brand does not provide a starter kit with this product. The oven comes with a 1-year manufacturer warranty from the date of purchase (terms and conditions apply).\r\n\r\nThe energy consumption details are as follows: the grill consumes 1200 W, the convection function uses 1950 W, and there are 5 microwave power levels. The microwave features an extensive collection of 251 auto-cook menus and recipes, offering options such as gujiyas, pakoras, pizza, pulao, roasted garlic, flaxseeds, cake, carrot and moon dal soup, gluten-free pasta, masoor pulao, kale and chickpea curry, flavored soy milk, and many other health-focused recipes.\r\n\r\nSpecial features include the ability to make ghee in 12 minutes (time may vary depending on the model), a quartz heater for concealed and safer cooking, a Health Plus menu, and a stainless steel cavity that ensures hygiene and durability. Additional features like a completion beeper and child lock add convenience and safety. The microwave also includes timed cooking, defrosting, programmable settings, a timer, turntable, steam clean, keep warm, energy-saving mode, and dehumidification to keep foods like biscuits, chips, and namkeens fresh and crisp.\r\n\r\nThe dimensions of the microwave are 51 cm x 30.5 cm x 49.5 cm (W x H x D), with a stainless steel inner cavity and a turntable diameter of 12.59 inches. The package includes one microwave oven, a glass tray, a rotating ring, and a user manual.', '2024-09-04 05:56:54', '2024-09-04 05:56:54', 18, 14),
(227, 'Bajaj DX-6 1000W Dry Iron with Advance Soleplate and Anti-bacterial German Coating Technology, White', NULL, 0, NULL, 'Majesty DX 6 1000-Watt Dry Iron (White) by R.D. & COMPANY', '2024-09-05 07:13:08', '2024-09-05 07:13:08', 39, 12),
(228, 'Bajaj MX-35N 2000W Steam Iron With Steam Burst, Anti-Drip & Anti-Scale Technology, Vertical And Horizontal Ironing, Non-Stick Coated Soleplate, Black & Pink, 2000 Watts', NULL, 0, NULL, 'This dry iron features anti-drip and anti-scale technology, along with a non-stick coated soleplate for smooth gliding over fabrics. It offers variable steam output to accommodate a wide range of clothing types and includes a built-in thermal fuse for added safety. With a power rating of 2000 watts and an operating voltage of 220 - 240 volts, it delivers efficient performance. The iron comes with a 2-year warranty, ensuring peace of mind, and includes one iron in the package. Available in a standard size, it is designed to meet your everyday ironing needs.', '2024-09-05 07:26:52', '2024-09-05 07:26:52', 39, 12);
